WEBVTT

1
00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Blessed by heaven and earth,

2
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:38.000
the Chaos Pearl was born.

3
00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:41.000
The Supreme Lord split it into two.

4
00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:44.000
The celestial energy
within became the Spirit Pearl,

5
00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:46.000
while the demonic energy
formed the Demon Orb.

6
00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:50.000
A Wrath of Heaven curse
was cast on the Demon Orb,

7
00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:55.000
set to destroy it with
lightning in three years.

8
00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:59.000
Later, due to Shen Gongbao's intervening,

9
00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:03.000
the Demon Orb reincarnated as Nezha,
third son of Li Jing in Chentang Pass.

10
00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:07.000
The Spirit Pearl became Ao Bing,
also the third son of the Loong King.

11
00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:10.000
By fate,

12
00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:13.000
the two became best friends.

13
00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:17.000
Nezha, influenced by his parents,

14
00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:18.000
shed his demonic nature,

15
00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:21.000
and saved Chentang Pass.

16
00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:23.000
Together with Ao Bing,

17
00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:25.000
they faced the Wrath of Heaven,

18
00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:27.000
and at last

19
00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:32.000
changed their destinies.

20
00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:48.000
Though survived the wrath,

21
00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:50.000
your bodies were destroyed...

22
00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:52.000
without which

23
00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:55.000
the soul will soon fade into oblivion.

24
00:01:55.000 --> 00:01:57.000
The Sacred Lotus
protects and nurtures spirit.

25
00:01:57.000 --> 00:02:00.000
I will now use it to recreate

26
00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:04.000
your physical forms.

27
00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:31.000
Wow.

28
00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:33.000
Stunning.

29
00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:34.000
Start up!

30
00:03:07.000 --> 00:03:08.000
Something's off...

31
00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:09.000
The lotus root must be powdered

32
00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:12.000
to make your bodies.

33
00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:14.000
with that hand?

34
00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:15.000
Oh, don't worry.

35
00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:18.000
I don't mind sticky foot,
a quick wash will fix it.

36
00:03:18.000 --> 00:03:21.000
It's not your foot I care.

37
00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:23.000
Did you just blow your nose with that hand?

38
00:03:23.000 --> 00:03:25.000
No, nothing.

39
00:03:25.000 --> 00:03:26.000
It's just lotus powder.

40
00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:27.000
See?

41
00:03:27.000 --> 00:03:28.000
Lotus powder.

42
00:03:29.000 --> 00:03:31.000
It's ready to go.

43
00:03:31.000 --> 00:03:32.000
Here, come on.

44
00:03:32.000 --> 00:03:34.000
One booger for each of you.

45
00:03:34.000 --> 00:03:36.000
I mean one serving.

46
00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:38.000
Chop-chop! To save your souls.

47
00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:39.000
I'd rather...

48
00:03:39.000 --> 00:03:42.000
Pain in the ass, little bastard!

49
00:03:47.000 --> 00:03:49.000
It works!

50
00:03:49.000 --> 00:03:51.000
Hang on.

51
00:03:51.000 --> 00:03:52.000
What is this?

52
00:03:52.000 --> 00:03:53.000
Thanks to you.

53
00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:56.000
I've been looking all over.

54
00:03:59.000 --> 00:04:01.000
Time for shaping.

55
00:04:02.000 --> 00:04:05.000
Flying Pig's memory is unmatched,

56
00:04:05.000 --> 00:04:09.000
so is his carving skills.

57
00:04:09.000 --> 00:04:12.000
Perfect renovation, right?

58
00:04:15.000 --> 00:04:17.000
Thanks, Piggy.

59
00:04:17.000 --> 00:04:20.000
Don't move, not fixed yet.

60
00:04:21.000 --> 00:04:22.000
Master Immortal,

61
00:04:22.000 --> 00:04:24.000
I've mobilized all of Chentang's forces

62
00:04:24.000 --> 00:04:26.000
on guarding of Shen Gongbao
and the Eastern Sea Loongs.

63
00:04:26.000 --> 00:04:27.000
Take it easy.

64
00:04:27.000 --> 00:04:28.000
The Loongs are watching the Abyss monsters,

65
00:04:28.000 --> 00:04:30.000
none of which would escape.

66
00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:32.000
Shen Gongbao alone is no threat.

67
00:04:32.000 --> 00:04:34.000
You should check this out.

68
00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:36.000
Isn't this impeccable?

69
00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:38.000
Woah!

70
00:04:38.000 --> 00:04:39.000
He learned from the best.

71
00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:40.000
But,

72
00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:42.000
does it have to be exactly the same?

73
00:04:42.000 --> 00:04:43.000
Can't you make me look better?

74
00:04:43.000 --> 00:04:45.000
Huh?

75
00:04:47.000 --> 00:04:49.000
Parents always pray good for kids, huh?

76
00:04:49.000 --> 00:04:51.000
Right.

77
00:04:51.000 --> 00:04:53.000
Make me tall and hunky.

78
00:04:53.000 --> 00:04:55.000
Also hauntingly handsome.

79
00:04:55.000 --> 00:04:58.000
A man must be strong and lofty.

80
00:04:58.000 --> 00:04:59.000
As well as demure and mindful.

81
00:04:59.000 --> 00:05:02.000
But also cute and lovable.

82
00:05:02.000 --> 00:05:04.000
Can you all make up your mind?

83
00:05:04.000 --> 00:05:05.000
Tall and hunky.

84
00:05:05.000 --> 00:05:07.000
With a touch of handsomeness.

85
00:05:07.000 --> 00:05:08.000
Strong and lofty.

86
00:05:08.000 --> 00:05:11.000
Yet super adorable.

87
00:05:14.000 --> 00:05:15.000
What's this?

88
00:05:15.000 --> 00:05:17.000
Start your performance then.

89
00:05:17.000 --> 00:05:18.000
Come on!

90
00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:19.000
I should've taken over earlier.

91
00:05:19.000 --> 00:05:20.000
DIY is always the best.

92
00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:22.000
This could take a while.

93
00:05:22.000 --> 00:05:25.000
Let's do you first.

94
00:05:25.000 --> 00:05:26.000
You were born of the water element,

95
00:05:26.000 --> 00:05:29.000
so you must be tempered by pure water.

96
00:05:46.000 --> 00:05:48.000
Open Lotus!

97
00:05:54.000 --> 00:05:56.000
Here we go.

98
00:05:56.000 --> 00:05:59.000
Are you done?

99
00:05:59.000 --> 00:06:02.000
Almost.

100
00:06:04.000 --> 00:06:07.000
This version is surely the most dazzling,

101
00:06:07.000 --> 00:06:10.000
but fine-tuning will take a long time.

102
00:06:10.000 --> 00:06:11.000
How about we just use
the first one for now?

103
00:06:11.000 --> 00:06:14.000
Yeah, the first version will do.

104
00:06:14.000 --> 00:06:16.000
I agree.

105
00:06:16.000 --> 00:06:19.000
Right.

106
00:06:19.000 --> 00:06:21.000
You were born of the fire element,

107
00:06:21.000 --> 00:06:24.000
so you must be refined in pure flames.

108
00:06:32.000 --> 00:06:33.000
Sir!

109
00:06:33.000 --> 00:06:34.000
Enemy has been spotted at sea.

110
00:06:34.000 --> 00:06:36.000
It seems to be Shen Gongbao.

111
00:06:36.000 --> 00:06:37.000
How many?

112
00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:38.000
Just him.

113
00:06:38.000 --> 00:06:39.000
How come?

114
00:06:39.000 --> 00:06:41.000
Carry on with your spell.

115
00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:42.000
We'll handle the intruder.

116
00:06:42.000 --> 00:06:43.000
Master Immortal,

117
00:06:43.000 --> 00:06:44.000
let me go plead with my master.

118
00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:45.000
Don't move!

119
00:06:45.000 --> 00:06:46.000
Before another incense
stick is fully burnt,

120
00:06:46.000 --> 00:06:48.000
your body won't be fixed.

121
00:07:15.000 --> 00:07:16.000
Shen Gongbao,

122
00:07:16.000 --> 00:07:19.000
to what do we owe this honor?

123
00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:22.000
Now that you know of
my plan with the Loongs,

124
00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:26.000
I can't help but feel un... uneasy.

125
00:07:26.000 --> 00:07:28.000
Chentang Pass is heavily guarded,

126
00:07:28.000 --> 00:07:29.000
and Master Taiyi is within the city.

127
00:07:29.000 --> 00:07:32.000
You, alone, won't accomplish much.

128
00:07:32.000 --> 00:07:40.000
Who... who said I'm alone?

129
00:07:41.000 --> 00:07:45.000
If they find out about the Spirit Pearl,

130
00:07:45.000 --> 00:07:48.000
not only will you fail to avenge your son,

131
00:07:48.000 --> 00:07:51.000
but the entire Eastern Loong Clan

132
00:07:51.000 --> 00:07:53.000
will bear the blame.

133
00:07:53.000 --> 00:07:54.000
When the truth comes out,

134
00:07:54.000 --> 00:07:56.000
you'll be cast into the abyss purgatory,

135
00:07:56.000 --> 00:07:58.000
surrounded by all your old "fellows".

136
00:07:58.000 --> 00:08:00.000
Let's see how we welcome you.

137
00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:01.000
Being stuck in Loong Palace...

138
00:08:01.000 --> 00:08:04.000
How could you avenge your son?

139
00:08:04.000 --> 00:08:07.000
Even I feel nervous for you.

140
00:08:15.000 --> 00:08:18.000
You fools are in no place to gloat.

141
00:08:18.000 --> 00:08:21.000
I was simply trying to help.

142
00:08:21.000 --> 00:08:23.000
But it seems that you

143
00:08:23.000 --> 00:08:25.000
don't appreciate it.

144
00:08:25.000 --> 00:08:27.000
Hmm?

145
00:08:34.000 --> 00:08:37.000
You must've forgotten what I'm capable of.

146
00:08:40.000 --> 00:08:41.000
Ah!

147
00:08:41.000 --> 00:08:42.000
I know this one.

148
00:08:42.000 --> 00:08:45.000
The Sky... Sky... Sky...

149
00:08:45.000 --> 00:08:47.000
Sky Splitting Claw.

150
00:08:47.000 --> 00:08:50.000
Thank you.

151
00:08:51.000 --> 00:08:55.000
Master Shen can take
this claw to Chentang Pass,

152
00:08:55.000 --> 00:08:58.000
and use it to tear open
a rift leading back to me.

153
00:08:58.000 --> 00:09:05.000
The Abyss Monsters can
then help you destroy your enemy.

154
00:09:51.000 --> 00:09:54.000
The Abyss Monsters?

155
00:09:54.000 --> 00:09:55.000
How... is that possible?

156
00:09:55.000 --> 00:09:57.000
They were trapped by the Suppression Seal
for thousand years.

157
00:09:57.000 --> 00:09:58.000
How could they possibly escape?

158
00:09:58.000 --> 00:10:00.000
The Loongs... have they
already released them?

159
00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:03.000
With the Sea-Stabilizing Chains binding us,

160
00:10:03.000 --> 00:10:06.000
there's no chance for escape.

161
00:10:06.000 --> 00:10:09.000
This is a win-win tactic.

162
00:10:09.000 --> 00:10:11.000
What do you say, my brother?

163
00:10:11.000 --> 00:10:14.000
You wouldn't be so generous.

164
00:10:14.000 --> 00:10:16.000
Get to the point.

165
00:10:16.000 --> 00:10:18.000
What's your price?

166
00:10:19.000 --> 00:10:21.000
In this purgatory,

167
00:10:21.000 --> 00:10:22.000
where flames burn our bodies,

168
00:10:22.000 --> 00:10:24.000
every day feels like a year.

169
00:10:24.000 --> 00:10:27.000
If you could slightly
lower the lava's heat,

170
00:10:27.000 --> 00:10:30.000
easing our suffering,

171
00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:34.000
we'd be willing to serve
you with all our might.

172
00:10:34.000 --> 00:10:36.000
What's going on?

173
00:10:36.000 --> 00:10:38.000
What is Shen Gongbao up to now?

174
00:10:45.000 --> 00:10:49.000
Finally, we're out! Yay!

175
00:10:49.000 --> 00:10:52.000
Bye-bye!

176
00:10:54.000 --> 00:10:56.000
Vile.

177
00:10:56.000 --> 00:10:57.000
We're doomed.

178
00:10:57.000 --> 00:10:59.000
How will we explain this to General Li now?

179
00:10:59.000 --> 00:11:01.000
Luckily no one saw us.

180
00:11:01.000 --> 00:11:02.000
Here.

181
00:11:02.000 --> 00:11:03.000
I'll break you arms

182
00:11:03.000 --> 00:11:04.000
and then you break my legs.

183
00:11:04.000 --> 00:11:05.000
We'll say the Yaksha did it.

184
00:11:05.000 --> 00:11:06.000
Oh.

185
00:11:06.000 --> 00:11:08.000
When the general sees how badly we're hurt,

186
00:11:08.000 --> 00:11:10.000
he won't blame us anymore.

187
00:11:10.000 --> 00:11:11.000
Try your best.

188
00:11:11.000 --> 00:11:13.000
Hit harder!

189
00:11:15.000 --> 00:11:18.000
Hey!

190
00:11:19.000 --> 00:11:21.000
Hey, you two!

191
00:11:23.000 --> 00:11:24.000
Master Immortal,

192
00:11:24.000 --> 00:11:25.000
you're here!

193
00:11:25.000 --> 00:11:26.000
Hee hee hee!

194
00:11:26.000 --> 00:11:27.000
Ha ha ha!

195
00:11:27.000 --> 00:11:29.000
He let the Yaksha get away!

196
00:11:29.000 --> 00:11:30.000
Huh?

197
00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:32.000
It was all your fault.

198
00:11:32.000 --> 00:11:35.000
Who are you to play innocent?

199
00:11:37.000 --> 00:11:38.000
Oh my,

200
00:11:38.000 --> 00:11:39.000
Dumb and Dumber!

201
00:11:39.000 --> 00:11:40.000
Hey!

202
00:11:40.000 --> 00:11:42.000
You two boneheads!

203
00:11:42.000 --> 00:11:44.000
Get over here and guard me!

204
00:11:44.000 --> 00:11:47.000
Yes, Sir! Right away!

205
00:12:53.000 --> 00:12:57.000
Show no mercy.

206
00:13:47.000 --> 00:13:48.000
Shen Gongbao!

207
00:13:48.000 --> 00:13:49.000
Ao Bing is not dead.

208
00:13:49.000 --> 00:13:52.000
Chentang Pass and the Loongs
have no reason to fight.

209
00:13:52.000 --> 00:13:55.000
Taiyi is rebuilding Ao
Bing's body right now.

210
00:13:57.000 --> 00:13:59.000
Liar!

211
00:13:59.000 --> 00:14:00.000
Hmm?

212
00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:02.000
The shield...

213
00:14:03.000 --> 00:14:05.000
No!

214
00:14:20.000 --> 00:14:22.000
Master!

215
00:14:22.000 --> 00:14:23.000
Ao Bing!

216
00:14:23.000 --> 00:14:25.000
Master Taiyi has built me a new body.

217
00:14:25.000 --> 00:14:27.000
Please, ceasefire.

218
00:14:27.000 --> 00:14:28.000
I saved your disciple.

219
00:14:28.000 --> 00:14:29.000
How will you thank me?

220
00:14:29.000 --> 00:14:30.000
So,

221
00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:34.000
that's Nezha in there?

222
00:14:35.000 --> 00:14:37.000
Why, you ungrateful bastard!

223
00:14:37.000 --> 00:14:38.000
Master!

224
00:14:38.000 --> 00:14:41.000
They must die!

225
00:14:45.000 --> 00:14:47.000
Ha ha ha!

226
00:14:47.000 --> 00:14:49.000
You think you can break this shield?

227
00:14:49.000 --> 00:14:51.000
Hit me! Come on!

228
00:15:16.000 --> 00:15:18.000
No!

229
00:15:49.000 --> 00:15:51.000
The aura...

230
00:15:59.000 --> 00:16:00.000
Ao Bing!

231
00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:02.000
Father!

232
00:16:13.000 --> 00:16:14.000
Father!

233
00:16:14.000 --> 00:16:16.000
I failed the mission to save our kind.

234
00:16:16.000 --> 00:16:17.000
No.

235
00:16:17.000 --> 00:16:18.000
None of that matters.

236
00:16:18.000 --> 00:16:20.000
I just want you to be safe.

237
00:16:20.000 --> 00:16:21.000
As long as you're here,

238
00:16:21.000 --> 00:16:24.000
it's enough for me.

239
00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:32.000
Open Lotus!

240
00:16:39.000 --> 00:16:40.000
Your body, what is...

241
00:16:40.000 --> 00:16:41.000
Please, he's literally a newborn.

242
00:16:41.000 --> 00:16:43.000
How could he take a hit like that?

243
00:16:43.000 --> 00:16:44.000
Ao Bing!

244
00:16:44.000 --> 00:16:46.000
Hey! It's not ready yet!

245
00:16:46.000 --> 00:16:47.000
Don't move! Don't move!

246
00:16:47.000 --> 00:16:48.000
Ao Bing, what's going on?

247
00:16:48.000 --> 00:16:51.000
Never move before fixed.

248
00:16:51.000 --> 00:16:52.000
If your body exceeds its limit,

249
00:16:52.000 --> 00:16:53.000
it will collapse!

250
00:16:53.000 --> 00:16:55.000
For heaven's sake...

251
00:16:55.000 --> 00:16:56.000
Fatty!

252
00:16:56.000 --> 00:16:58.000
Make another bod... body for Ao Bing now!

253
00:16:58.000 --> 00:16:59.000
Huh?

254
00:16:59.000 --> 00:17:01.000
Making two bodies back-to-back

255
00:17:01.000 --> 00:17:02.000
has completely drained
the Sacred Lotus's energy.

256
00:17:02.000 --> 00:17:04.000
Without a body, won't his soul scatter?

257
00:17:04.000 --> 00:17:05.000
Master, do something!

258
00:17:05.000 --> 00:17:08.000
there's nothing I can do.

259
00:17:08.000 --> 00:17:09.000
It's okay.

260
00:17:09.000 --> 00:17:12.000
I took your place as the Spirit Pearl,
I deserve this.

261
00:17:12.000 --> 00:17:14.000
If my sacrifice

262
00:17:14.000 --> 00:17:16.000
can bring you back to life,

263
00:17:16.000 --> 00:17:18.000
then it's a fair price to pay.

264
00:17:18.000 --> 00:17:19.000
Who asked you to?

265
00:17:19.000 --> 00:17:20.000
I am happy being the Demon Orb.

266
00:17:20.000 --> 00:17:23.000
Don't you dare to die!

267
00:17:23.000 --> 00:17:24.000
Father,

268
00:17:24.000 --> 00:17:27.000
please spare Chentang Pass.

269
00:17:27.000 --> 00:17:30.000
We should stop the mistakes.

270
00:17:30.000 --> 00:17:34.000
This is my final wish.

271
00:17:38.000 --> 00:17:39.000
There has to be other ways.

272
00:17:39.000 --> 00:17:41.000
There has to.

273
00:17:41.000 --> 00:17:43.000
You! Try harder!

274
00:17:43.000 --> 00:17:45.000
Let Ao Bing share your body for now.

275
00:17:45.000 --> 00:17:46.000
Share your body.

276
00:17:46.000 --> 00:17:49.000
Two souls sharing one body,

277
00:17:49.000 --> 00:17:50.000
rejection is inevitable.

278
00:17:50.000 --> 00:17:52.000
The Spirit Pearl and Demon Orb come
from the same source.

279
00:17:52.000 --> 00:17:53.000
Sharing one body

280
00:17:53.000 --> 00:17:55.000
for seven days shouldn't be a problem.

281
00:17:55.000 --> 00:17:56.000
That's it!

282
00:17:56.000 --> 00:17:57.000
Ao Bing, come on up!

283
00:17:57.000 --> 00:17:59.000
Quick!

284
00:17:59.000 --> 00:18:01.000
Okay.

285
00:18:07.000 --> 00:18:09.000
This feels... strange...

286
00:18:09.000 --> 00:18:10.000
Ao Bing, are you here?

287
00:18:10.000 --> 00:18:11.000
Yes, I am.

288
00:18:11.000 --> 00:18:13.000
I can hear your voice in my head!

289
00:18:13.000 --> 00:18:14.000
This is fun!

290
00:18:14.000 --> 00:18:16.000
But this is only a temporary fix.

291
00:18:16.000 --> 00:18:18.000
What happens after seven days?

292
00:18:18.000 --> 00:18:20.000
There's some potion in
the vault of Yu Xu Palace.

293
00:18:20.000 --> 00:18:22.000
Elixir Reparo.

294
00:18:22.000 --> 00:18:25.000
It can restore the divine
power of magical items.

295
00:18:25.000 --> 00:18:26.000
With it,

296
00:18:26.000 --> 00:18:29.000
the Sacred Lotus will bloom again.

297
00:18:29.000 --> 00:18:31.000
But how will you obtain it?

298
00:18:31.000 --> 00:18:33.000
I'll go to the Supreme Lord himself
and beg for it.

299
00:18:33.000 --> 00:18:34.000
Or are you planning to

300
00:18:34.000 --> 00:18:36.000
report on me and the Loongs?

301
00:18:36.000 --> 00:18:40.000
Save a son of the Loongs.

302
00:18:40.000 --> 00:18:42.000
If asking doesn't work,

303
00:18:42.000 --> 00:18:43.000
then we'll just take.

304
00:18:43.000 --> 00:18:45.000
Yu Xu Palace is at the
core of the Chan Sect,

305
00:18:45.000 --> 00:18:46.000
protected by formidable powers.

306
00:18:46.000 --> 00:18:48.000
For my son,

307
00:18:48.000 --> 00:18:50.000
I'll break into the Court
of Heaven if I had to.

308
00:18:50.000 --> 00:18:52.000
Your Majesty, calm down.

309
00:18:52.000 --> 00:18:53.000
I might have a plan.

310
00:18:53.000 --> 00:18:56.000
Chan disciples who excel in their training

311
00:18:56.000 --> 00:18:58.000
can participate in the Ascension Trial.

312
00:18:58.000 --> 00:19:01.000
Passing the trial grants
not only immortality,

313
00:19:01.000 --> 00:19:04.000
but also the right to choose one

314
00:19:04.000 --> 00:19:07.000
ma... magic item from the
Yu Xu Vault as a reward.

315
00:19:07.000 --> 00:19:09.000
Nezha participate in the trial

316
00:19:09.000 --> 00:19:10.000
to obtain the elixir?

317
00:19:10.000 --> 00:19:11.000
No, no, no!

318
00:19:11.000 --> 00:19:12.000
He's beaming with demonic energy!

319
00:19:12.000 --> 00:19:14.000
As soon as he uses his
powers, he'll be exposed!

320
00:19:14.000 --> 00:19:16.000
Isn't Ao Bing sharing Nezha's body?

321
00:19:16.000 --> 00:19:19.000
His divine aura can mask
the demonic energy perfectly.

322
00:19:19.000 --> 00:19:21.000
As long as he passes
the trial within seven days,

323
00:19:21.000 --> 00:19:24.000
not only will we have the el... elixir...

324
00:19:24.000 --> 00:19:25.000
But he can also

325
00:19:25.000 --> 00:19:27.000
achieve immortality!

326
00:19:27.000 --> 00:19:28.000
Then I'm not a demon anymore?

327
00:19:28.000 --> 00:19:32.000
This will save both Ao Bing and Nezha.

328
00:19:32.000 --> 00:19:34.000
Eve... everyone is happy.

329
00:19:34.000 --> 00:19:37.000
This isn't the right thing to do.

330
00:19:37.000 --> 00:19:39.000
Then what do you suggest?

331
00:19:39.000 --> 00:19:41.000
Follow the rules.

332
00:19:41.000 --> 00:19:42.000
Come clean with the Supreme Lord

333
00:19:42.000 --> 00:19:44.000
and trust his judgement.

334
00:19:44.000 --> 00:19:46.000
My wife and I will also plead for mercy,

335
00:19:46.000 --> 00:19:50.000
so the sins of the parents
don't affect the children.

336
00:19:50.000 --> 00:19:52.000
Mere mortals,

337
00:19:52.000 --> 00:19:54.000
you have only decades of life experience,

338
00:19:54.000 --> 00:19:58.000
how dare you lecture me about morality?

339
00:20:04.000 --> 00:20:06.000
Longer than I could remember,

340
00:20:06.000 --> 00:20:08.000
I've lived for thousands of years.

341
00:20:08.000 --> 00:20:11.000
Let me tell you one
truth and one truth only.

342
00:20:11.000 --> 00:20:13.000
If my son die,

343
00:20:13.000 --> 00:20:18.000
I'll have Chentang Pass sink with him.

344
00:20:24.000 --> 00:20:26.000
Stop!

345
00:20:26.000 --> 00:20:27.000
Ao Bing is my friend.

346
00:20:27.000 --> 00:20:29.000
I will save him for sure.

347
00:20:29.000 --> 00:20:31.000
But if you dare to harm Chentang Pass,

348
00:20:31.000 --> 00:20:33.000
I'll smash your Loong Palace

349
00:20:33.000 --> 00:20:36.000
into P-I-E-C-E-S!

350
00:20:40.000 --> 00:20:42.000
Except for Nezha and Taiyi,

351
00:20:42.000 --> 00:20:45.000
no one leaves Chentang Pass from now on.

352
00:20:45.000 --> 00:20:47.000
If in seven days I don't see Elixir Reparo

353
00:20:47.000 --> 00:20:50.000
or the news of my clan gets out,

354
00:20:50.000 --> 00:20:53.000
I'll let Chentang Pass

355
00:20:53.000 --> 00:20:55.000
sink forever.

356
00:20:55.000 --> 00:20:57.000
I don't trust my siblings,

357
00:20:57.000 --> 00:21:00.000
and I can't stay out of my body for long.

358
00:21:00.000 --> 00:21:01.000
The fate of Chentang Pass

359
00:21:01.000 --> 00:21:04.000
is in your hands.

360
00:21:07.000 --> 00:21:08.000
Yes.

361
00:21:08.000 --> 00:21:09.000
Exactly.

362
00:21:09.000 --> 00:21:11.000
There's no message that can't be conveyed

363
00:21:11.000 --> 00:21:14.000
with just a nod.

364
00:21:20.000 --> 00:21:21.000
Lord Li,

365
00:21:21.000 --> 00:21:24.000
we're all here to say goodbye to
Young Master Nezha.

366
00:21:24.000 --> 00:21:28.000
We want to thank him
for saving the entire city.

367
00:21:28.000 --> 00:21:29.000
You're too kind.

368
00:21:29.000 --> 00:21:30.000
My son has caused enough troubles

369
00:21:30.000 --> 00:21:31.000
over the years.

370
00:21:31.000 --> 00:21:36.000
I always knew the Young Master
was destined for greatness.

371
00:21:36.000 --> 00:21:37.000
Look at him,

372
00:21:37.000 --> 00:21:38.000
a wide forehead,

373
00:21:38.000 --> 00:21:40.000
broad face,

374
00:21:40.000 --> 00:21:41.000
prominent nose,

375
00:21:41.000 --> 00:21:43.000
full cheeks and thick lips.

376
00:21:43.000 --> 00:21:46.000
All signs of a true hero!

377
00:21:46.000 --> 00:21:50.000
I've never been wrong in reading faces.

378
00:21:52.000 --> 00:21:56.000
Young Master,
remember to brush your teeth after meals!

379
00:21:56.000 --> 00:21:58.000
Boss,

380
00:21:58.000 --> 00:22:00.000
the Demon Slayers is now re-branded
as the Nezha Gang.

381
00:22:00.000 --> 00:22:04.000
All members will follow your orders.

382
00:22:04.000 --> 00:22:05.000
Young Master, want to practice calligraphy?

383
00:22:05.000 --> 00:22:06.000
I'm here for you!

384
00:22:06.000 --> 00:22:07.000
Young Master, you're three years old now.

385
00:22:07.000 --> 00:22:08.000
It's time to get a girlfriend.

386
00:22:08.000 --> 00:22:09.000
Any interests in instrument?

387
00:22:09.000 --> 00:22:12.000
We're proficient in all of them.

388
00:22:13.000 --> 00:22:14.000
I want to

389
00:22:14.000 --> 00:22:16.000
play shuttlecock.

390
00:22:17.000 --> 00:22:18.000
What?

391
00:22:18.000 --> 00:22:20.000
It's fun.

392
00:22:20.000 --> 00:22:22.000
Anyone?

393
00:22:24.000 --> 00:22:26.000
I'll play with you.

394
00:22:26.000 --> 00:22:28.000
Didn't you always want to
play shuttlecock with me?

395
00:22:28.000 --> 00:22:29.000
Well...

396
00:22:29.000 --> 00:22:31.000
he's a bit hard on the kicks.

397
00:22:31.000 --> 00:22:32.000
Ha ha ha!

398
00:22:32.000 --> 00:22:35.000
I'm a general of war!

399
00:22:36.000 --> 00:22:37.000
Dad.

400
00:22:37.000 --> 00:22:39.000
That's my boy!

401
00:22:39.000 --> 00:22:40.000
How about...

402
00:22:40.000 --> 00:22:41.000
we do it another day?

403
00:22:41.000 --> 00:22:43.000
Nonsense!

404
00:22:43.000 --> 00:22:45.000
Why stop when you're having fun?

405
00:22:45.000 --> 00:22:46.000
It's fine. I'm fine.

406
00:22:46.000 --> 00:22:47.000
I'll join too!

407
00:22:47.000 --> 00:22:49.000
My lady, you don't have to do this.

408
00:22:49.000 --> 00:22:50.000
Are you looking down on me?

409
00:22:50.000 --> 00:22:52.000
I'm also a general of war!

410
00:22:52.000 --> 00:22:53.000
Nezha,

411
00:22:53.000 --> 00:22:55.000
catch this!

412
00:22:56.000 --> 00:22:59.000
how did you miss that?

413
00:22:59.000 --> 00:23:00.000
If only I weren't the Demon Orb...

414
00:23:00.000 --> 00:23:01.000
What was that?

415
00:23:01.000 --> 00:23:03.000
Nothing.

416
00:23:03.000 --> 00:23:04.000
It's time to go.

417
00:23:04.000 --> 00:23:05.000
Before you go,

418
00:23:05.000 --> 00:23:06.000
will you give your mother

419
00:23:06.000 --> 00:23:09.000
a big hug?

420
00:23:11.000 --> 00:23:14.000
Please, people are watching.

421
00:23:15.000 --> 00:23:17.000
Wait.

422
00:23:18.000 --> 00:23:19.000
Here are some snacks I made.

423
00:23:19.000 --> 00:23:21.000
For you and your master on the road.

424
00:23:21.000 --> 00:23:22.000
Okay, okay.

425
00:23:22.000 --> 00:23:23.000
Hey!

426
00:23:23.000 --> 00:23:25.000
I'm not on board yet!

427
00:23:30.000 --> 00:23:31.000
Your body isn't fully fixed.

428
00:23:31.000 --> 00:23:33.000
Don't use too much force.

429
00:23:33.000 --> 00:23:34.000
Alright, alright.

430
00:23:34.000 --> 00:23:36.000
And watch your temper.

431
00:23:36.000 --> 00:23:38.000
Try to stay calm out there.

432
00:23:38.000 --> 00:23:40.000
Without me and your father by your side,

433
00:23:40.000 --> 00:23:44.000
learn to take care of yourself.

434
00:23:44.000 --> 00:23:45.000
You silly child.

435
00:23:45.000 --> 00:23:47.000
What's wrong with just a hug?

436
00:23:47.000 --> 00:23:48.000
That's too much.

437
00:23:48.000 --> 00:23:49.000
It's not a farewell anyway.

438
00:23:49.000 --> 00:23:51.000
Let's move.

439
00:24:07.000 --> 00:24:08.000
Why are you sighing?

440
00:24:08.000 --> 00:24:09.000
Taste bad?

441
00:24:09.000 --> 00:24:10.000
All you know is food.

442
00:24:10.000 --> 00:24:11.000
Look at me.

443
00:24:11.000 --> 00:24:12.000
I'm too worried to even eat!

444
00:24:12.000 --> 00:24:15.000
Have you thought about
how to pass the trial?

445
00:24:16.000 --> 00:24:17.000
What is the trial about?

446
00:24:17.000 --> 00:24:20.000
It'll test the progress
of your cultivation.

447
00:24:20.000 --> 00:24:21.000
In front of the judges,

448
00:24:21.000 --> 00:24:22.000
you must defeat, barehanded,

449
00:24:22.000 --> 00:24:24.000
three demon kings of earth-monster level.

450
00:24:24.000 --> 00:24:25.000
Fighting...

451
00:24:25.000 --> 00:24:26.000
That's my specialty!

452
00:24:26.000 --> 00:24:27.000
But as soon as you give off demonic energy,

453
00:24:27.000 --> 00:24:28.000
your identity will be exposed.

454
00:24:28.000 --> 00:24:29.000
Just let Ao Bing control my body.

455
00:24:29.000 --> 00:24:30.000
His divine energy

456
00:24:30.000 --> 00:24:32.000
will be just as powerful.

457
00:24:32.000 --> 00:24:33.000
Sounds easy.

458
00:24:33.000 --> 00:24:35.000
Let's try.

459
00:24:35.000 --> 00:24:36.000
Nezha,

460
00:24:36.000 --> 00:24:37.000
fully relax your body.

461
00:24:37.000 --> 00:24:41.000
Let Ao Bing take control and fight me.

462
00:24:43.000 --> 00:24:45.000
Ao Bing, what are you doing?

463
00:24:45.000 --> 00:24:46.000
Keep steady!

464
00:24:46.000 --> 00:24:47.000
When a soul inhabits another body,

465
00:24:47.000 --> 00:24:50.000
unless your willpower is much stronger
than the host's,

466
00:24:50.000 --> 00:24:53.000
you won't be able to fully control it.

467
00:24:55.000 --> 00:24:56.000
Nezha, step back.

468
00:24:56.000 --> 00:24:57.000
The harder you push,

469
00:24:57.000 --> 00:25:00.000
the less Ao Bing can control.

470
00:25:00.000 --> 00:25:01.000
Use your leg!

471
00:25:01.000 --> 00:25:03.000
Sweep him, sweep him!

472
00:25:11.000 --> 00:25:14.000
I'm coming...

473
00:25:15.000 --> 00:25:17.000
for you.

474
00:25:23.000 --> 00:25:24.000
Having fun, huh?

475
00:25:24.000 --> 00:25:25.000
We're almost at Yu Xu Palace,

476
00:25:25.000 --> 00:25:26.000
and you're still messing around.

477
00:25:26.000 --> 00:25:27.000
Look at yourself,

478
00:25:27.000 --> 00:25:29.000
what kind of mentor are you?

479
00:25:29.000 --> 00:25:30.000
Stand here and reflect on your mistakes.

480
00:25:30.000 --> 00:25:32.000
No meals until you figure it out!

481
00:25:32.000 --> 00:25:33.000
You're a grown man.

482
00:25:33.000 --> 00:25:36.000
Stop acting like a reckless teenager.

483
00:25:36.000 --> 00:25:37.000
I got it!

484
00:25:37.000 --> 00:25:40.000
The Sleepy-Slumber Pill.

485
00:25:40.000 --> 00:25:41.000
What's that?

486
00:25:41.000 --> 00:25:43.000
Take this, and you'll
fall asleep immediately.

487
00:25:43.000 --> 00:25:44.000
Once you're asleep,

488
00:25:44.000 --> 00:25:47.000
Ao Bing can fully control your body.

489
00:25:47.000 --> 00:25:49.000
Brilliant!

490
00:25:49.000 --> 00:25:50.000
One is enough.

491
00:25:50.000 --> 00:25:52.000
Should've told me...

492
00:25:52.000 --> 00:25:54.000
earlier.

493
00:25:55.000 --> 00:25:57.000
Perfect.

494
00:26:03.000 --> 00:26:05.000
Master Taiyi?

495
00:26:05.000 --> 00:26:08.000
Now this feels like the real deal.

496
00:26:08.000 --> 00:26:10.000
What's wrong?

497
00:26:10.000 --> 00:26:11.000
Don't worry.

498
00:26:11.000 --> 00:26:15.000
I see you've completely
taken over Nezha's body.

499
00:26:15.000 --> 00:26:17.000
Let's go again.

500
00:26:17.000 --> 00:26:20.000
This time, I won't hold back.

501
00:26:20.000 --> 00:26:24.000
You'd better give it your all, too.

502
00:26:33.000 --> 00:26:35.000
I humbly seek your guidance.

503
00:26:35.000 --> 00:26:36.000
Not bad.

504
00:26:36.000 --> 00:26:37.000
Barely able to match my skills.

505
00:26:37.000 --> 00:26:38.000
Master Taiyi,

506
00:26:38.000 --> 00:26:40.000
your nose is bleeding.

507
00:26:40.000 --> 00:26:41.000
Too heaty recently.

508
00:26:41.000 --> 00:26:42.000
Need more water.

509
00:26:42.000 --> 00:26:44.000
No big deal.

510
00:26:51.000 --> 00:26:54.000
Kunlun Mountain! We're here.

511
00:26:54.000 --> 00:26:55.000
I heard a day here

512
00:26:55.000 --> 00:26:56.000
equals a year in the mortal world.

513
00:26:56.000 --> 00:26:57.000
Don't worry.

514
00:26:57.000 --> 00:26:58.000
We're not in the celestial realm yet.

515
00:26:58.000 --> 00:26:59.000
But this many people?

516
00:26:59.000 --> 00:27:01.000
They've all come to seek immortality.

517
00:27:01.000 --> 00:27:02.000
Chan Sect is famous across the world,

518
00:27:02.000 --> 00:27:04.000
and everyone wants to join.

519
00:27:05.000 --> 00:27:06.000
Look at this.

520
00:27:06.000 --> 00:27:07.000
The jasper.

521
00:27:07.000 --> 00:27:08.000
It's the credential of
a Chan Sect immortal.

522
00:27:08.000 --> 00:27:09.000
With it,

523
00:27:09.000 --> 00:27:11.000
you'll receive respect everywhere you go.

524
00:27:11.000 --> 00:27:12.000
I'm telling ya.

525
00:27:12.000 --> 00:27:14.000
Being an immortal is amazing.

526
00:27:14.000 --> 00:27:15.000
Both of your brothers have ascended.

527
00:27:15.000 --> 00:27:16.000
You'll have no problem either.

528
00:27:16.000 --> 00:27:18.000
I mean Nezha's brothers.

529
00:27:18.000 --> 00:27:19.000
His two brothers

530
00:27:19.000 --> 00:27:22.000
are among the best of
the third-generation disciples.

531
00:27:22.000 --> 00:27:23.000
You know

532
00:27:23.000 --> 00:27:24.000
how Nezha always misbehaves, right?

533
00:27:24.000 --> 00:27:27.000
So, I often tell stories about his brothers

534
00:27:27.000 --> 00:27:28.000
to set a good example for him.

535
00:27:28.000 --> 00:27:30.000
Let me tell you something,

536
00:27:30.000 --> 00:27:33.000
Nezha idolizes his brothers.

537
00:27:53.000 --> 00:27:54.000
Oh wow, you're lucky...

538
00:27:54.000 --> 00:27:57.000
to meet the well-known Demon Hunters.

539
00:27:57.000 --> 00:27:58.000
Demon Hunters?

540
00:27:58.000 --> 00:27:59.000
They roam the land, hunting down

541
00:27:59.000 --> 00:28:01.000
demons that wreak havoc on humanity,

542
00:28:01.000 --> 00:28:04.000
keeping the world at peace.

543
00:28:04.000 --> 00:28:05.000
The current leader of the Demon Hunters

544
00:28:05.000 --> 00:28:08.000
is the top disciple of Immortal Wuliang.

545
00:28:08.000 --> 00:28:11.000
Isn't his predecessor Shen Gongbao?

546
00:28:24.000 --> 00:28:25.000
Master Taiyi,

547
00:28:25.000 --> 00:28:26.000
what's that smoke over there?

548
00:28:26.000 --> 00:28:27.000
Oh.

549
00:28:27.000 --> 00:28:29.000
That's the most precious
treasure of Yu Xu Palace,

550
00:28:29.000 --> 00:28:32.000
The Tianyuan Cauldron.

551
00:28:39.000 --> 00:28:40.000
Brother Taiyi,

552
00:28:40.000 --> 00:28:43.000
it's been forever.

553
00:28:43.000 --> 00:28:44.000
Brother Wuliang!

554
00:28:44.000 --> 00:28:46.000
I heard that during Master's seclusion,

555
00:28:46.000 --> 00:28:48.000
you've been in charge of Yu Xu Palace.

556
00:28:48.000 --> 00:28:50.000
I've brought my disciple to participate
in the Ascension Trial.

557
00:28:50.000 --> 00:28:52.000
come at Master Wuliang.

558
00:28:52.000 --> 00:28:53.000
Master Wuliang.

559
00:28:53.000 --> 00:28:55.000
So, you're Nezha?

560
00:28:55.000 --> 00:28:57.000
The reincarnation of the Spirit Pearl?

561
00:28:57.000 --> 00:28:58.000
Oh my!

562
00:28:58.000 --> 00:29:00.000
How remarkable!

563
00:29:00.000 --> 00:29:04.000
The Supreme Lord holds
great expectations for you.

564
00:29:04.000 --> 00:29:05.000
And you sure don't disappoint.

565
00:29:05.000 --> 00:29:07.000
Look at him,

566
00:29:07.000 --> 00:29:09.000
so full of robust vitality.

567
00:29:09.000 --> 00:29:12.000
Giving off a righteous vibe.

568
00:29:19.000 --> 00:29:20.000
The boy's been over training lately.

569
00:29:20.000 --> 00:29:23.000
His state is a bit unstable.

570
00:29:25.000 --> 00:29:26.000
What do you think you're doing?

571
00:29:26.000 --> 00:29:28.000
This is Yu Xu Palace!

572
00:29:28.000 --> 00:29:29.000
I need to pee.

573
00:29:29.000 --> 00:29:30.000
Crana!

574
00:29:30.000 --> 00:29:31.000
Here!

575
00:29:31.000 --> 00:29:34.000
Take the child to the restroom.

576
00:29:34.000 --> 00:29:36.000
I didn't say anything about resting.

577
00:29:36.000 --> 00:29:37.000
Idiot!

578
00:29:37.000 --> 00:29:38.000
Restroom

579
00:29:38.000 --> 00:29:42.000
is where you pee.

580
00:29:42.000 --> 00:29:43.000
The boy's a bit rough.

581
00:29:43.000 --> 00:29:45.000
Please forgive him.

582
00:29:51.000 --> 00:29:52.000
Wow!

583
00:29:52.000 --> 00:29:58.000
So white!

584
00:29:58.000 --> 00:29:59.000
Wow!

585
00:29:59.000 --> 00:30:00.000
So white!

586
00:30:00.000 --> 00:30:02.000
Is the entire palace made of jade?

587
00:30:02.000 --> 00:30:04.000
Where did they get so
much money to buy jade?

588
00:30:04.000 --> 00:30:07.000
The "Yu" in Yu Xu Palace means jade, right?

589
00:30:07.000 --> 00:30:08.000
Then what does the "Xu" mean?

590
00:30:08.000 --> 00:30:09.000
Humble?

591
00:30:09.000 --> 00:30:10.000
Guilty?

592
00:30:10.000 --> 00:30:12.000
Or emptiness?

593
00:30:12.000 --> 00:30:14.000
Is the restroom also made of jade?

594
00:30:14.000 --> 00:30:16.000
Even immortals need to pee?

595
00:30:16.000 --> 00:30:19.000
Does Master Wuliang also... poop?

596
00:30:19.000 --> 00:30:20.000
This is a place of seclusion.

597
00:30:20.000 --> 00:30:22.000
Lower your voice.

598
00:30:22.000 --> 00:30:23.000
How much further is the restroom?

599
00:30:23.000 --> 00:30:24.000
I can't hold it anymore!

600
00:30:24.000 --> 00:30:26.000
Hey, sister, wait for me!

601
00:30:27.000 --> 00:30:29.000
You...

602
00:30:29.000 --> 00:30:30.000
I didn't mean it.

603
00:30:30.000 --> 00:30:31.000
I need to change my skirt.

604
00:30:31.000 --> 00:30:33.000
Go by yourself.

605
00:30:33.000 --> 00:30:34.000
But I don't know where the restroom is.

606
00:30:34.000 --> 00:30:37.000
Go through the corridor,
turn right, then left.

607
00:30:37.000 --> 00:30:40.000
Oh.

608
00:30:51.000 --> 00:30:53.000
Wow.

609
00:30:53.000 --> 00:30:54.000
How fancy it is!

610
00:30:54.000 --> 00:30:58.000
Radical!

611
00:31:20.000 --> 00:31:21.000
Emm...

612
00:31:21.000 --> 00:31:23.000
Am I lost?

613
00:31:23.000 --> 00:31:24.000
Where are you going?

614
00:31:24.000 --> 00:31:25.000
Oh.

615
00:31:25.000 --> 00:31:27.000
I got lost.

616
00:31:27.000 --> 00:31:29.000
Follow me.

617
00:31:29.000 --> 00:31:32.000
Brother, good job raising the Spirit Pearl.

618
00:31:32.000 --> 00:31:35.000
Another great achievement for the Sect.

619
00:31:35.000 --> 00:31:36.000
Not at all.

620
00:31:36.000 --> 00:31:38.000
It's all thanks to Master's guidance.

621
00:31:38.000 --> 00:31:42.000
This Kunlun Dew is a rare elixir.

622
00:31:42.000 --> 00:31:44.000
Normally, it takes six
months to fill a basin.

623
00:31:44.000 --> 00:31:46.000
But today, when I sent someone to check,

624
00:31:46.000 --> 00:31:48.000
it's already full!

625
00:31:48.000 --> 00:31:51.000
Your timing couldn't be better.

626
00:31:51.000 --> 00:31:52.000
Brother,

627
00:31:52.000 --> 00:31:56.000
luck sure favors you, doesn't it?

628
00:31:58.000 --> 00:31:59.000
What's wrong with you?

629
00:31:59.000 --> 00:32:01.000
Can't even drink water properly.

630
00:32:01.000 --> 00:32:02.000
My disciple is a bit crude.

631
00:32:02.000 --> 00:32:04.000
Please forgive him.

632
00:32:05.000 --> 00:32:07.000
My pee is in the water.

633
00:32:11.000 --> 00:32:12.000
My master is a bit crude, too.

634
00:32:12.000 --> 00:32:14.000
Please forgive him.

635
00:32:14.000 --> 00:32:15.000
time is of the essence.

636
00:32:15.000 --> 00:32:18.000
I think Nezha should go through
the trial immediately.

637
00:32:18.000 --> 00:32:19.000
Why the rush?

638
00:32:19.000 --> 00:32:21.000
Let's have a few more drinks first.

639
00:32:21.000 --> 00:32:23.000
No more, please.

640
00:32:23.000 --> 00:32:25.000
Alright then.

641
00:32:25.000 --> 00:32:28.000
My disciple Deero will be the judge.

642
00:32:28.000 --> 00:32:29.000
The next target of Demon Hunters

643
00:32:29.000 --> 00:32:31.000
could go to Nezha.

644
00:32:31.000 --> 00:32:33.000
Brother, excuse us.

645
00:32:36.000 --> 00:32:37.000
Taiyi, my brother,

646
00:32:37.000 --> 00:32:40.000
always so impatient.

647
00:32:43.000 --> 00:32:47.000
The taste of the Dew this year

648
00:32:48.000 --> 00:32:50.000
is especially rich.

649
00:32:50.000 --> 00:32:53.000
Keep using this method in the future.

650
00:32:53.000 --> 00:32:56.000
Yes, master.

651
00:33:35.000 --> 00:33:36.000
Why stop?

652
00:33:36.000 --> 00:33:37.000
It's been six hours,

653
00:33:37.000 --> 00:33:38.000
Master Shen.

654
00:33:38.000 --> 00:33:39.000
Too tired to continue.

655
00:33:39.000 --> 00:33:40.000
Rubbish!

656
00:33:40.000 --> 00:33:42.000
Cultivation allows no laziness.

657
00:33:42.000 --> 00:33:43.000
Without my permission

658
00:33:43.000 --> 00:33:46.000
you'll never stop.

659
00:33:51.000 --> 00:33:53.000
General Li Jing of Chentang Pass
is here to see you.

660
00:33:53.000 --> 00:33:54.000
Master Shen,

661
00:33:54.000 --> 00:33:55.000
yesterday's battle

662
00:33:55.000 --> 00:33:57.000
left many soldiers and civilians
of Chentang Pass injured.

663
00:33:57.000 --> 00:33:59.000
We've run out of medicine.

664
00:33:59.000 --> 00:34:02.000
I humbly ask you to open a path

665
00:34:02.000 --> 00:34:05.000
so that a few doctors can leave
the city to buy supplies.

666
00:34:09.000 --> 00:34:10.000
How bold!

667
00:34:10.000 --> 00:34:12.000
No wonder you're...

668
00:34:12.000 --> 00:34:13.000
Who did that?

669
00:34:13.000 --> 00:34:15.000
You son of a...

670
00:34:15.000 --> 00:34:16.000
I...

671
00:34:17.000 --> 00:34:20.000
St... stop, stop, stop!

672
00:34:25.000 --> 00:34:26.000
Bring me the one

673
00:34:26.000 --> 00:34:28.000
you caught earlier.

674
00:34:28.000 --> 00:34:31.000
He escaped the city during the battle.

675
00:34:31.000 --> 00:34:32.000
General Li, please,

676
00:34:32.000 --> 00:34:35.000
take him ba... back with you.

677
00:34:35.000 --> 00:34:36.000
This is a misunderstanding, Master Shen!

678
00:34:36.000 --> 00:34:38.000
I'm a demon too!

679
00:34:38.000 --> 00:34:39.000
I captured this Yaksha

680
00:34:39.000 --> 00:34:41.000
to clear my son's name.

681
00:34:41.000 --> 00:34:43.000
Now that it's settled,

682
00:34:43.000 --> 00:34:45.000
and since he hasn't done anything worse,

683
00:34:45.000 --> 00:34:47.000
just let him go.

684
00:34:47.000 --> 00:34:48.000
Yes, exactly.

685
00:34:48.000 --> 00:34:49.000
I'm just a small role.

686
00:34:49.000 --> 00:34:51.000
Insignificant.

687
00:34:51.000 --> 00:34:53.000
I don't think you understood me.

688
00:34:53.000 --> 00:34:57.000
No one leaves here, not even a demon.

689
00:34:57.000 --> 00:34:59.000
Let alone humans.

690
00:34:59.000 --> 00:35:00.000
Master Shen, please have mercy.

691
00:35:00.000 --> 00:35:03.000
I'm a demon, too.

692
00:35:03.000 --> 00:35:05.000
We are both villains!

693
00:35:05.000 --> 00:35:07.000
I'm n... not a villain.

694
00:35:07.000 --> 00:35:08.000
Everyone who knows the
secret of the Spirit Pearl

695
00:35:08.000 --> 00:35:10.000
must stay here.

696
00:35:10.000 --> 00:35:11.000
Without medicine,

697
00:35:11.000 --> 00:35:15.000
the injured won't survive.

698
00:35:16.000 --> 00:35:18.000
Master Shen, please,

699
00:35:18.000 --> 00:35:20.000
I'm only asking to save lives.

700
00:35:21.000 --> 00:35:22.000
Sir!

701
00:35:22.000 --> 00:35:23.000
We caught a spy.

702
00:35:23.000 --> 00:35:24.000
This man came from outside the city,

703
00:35:24.000 --> 00:35:26.000
and he injured some of our soldiers.

704
00:35:26.000 --> 00:35:27.000
Lock... lock him up too.

705
00:35:27.000 --> 00:35:29.000
Brother.

706
00:35:29.000 --> 00:35:30.000
Brother, is that you?

707
00:35:30.000 --> 00:35:32.000
You...

708
00:35:32.000 --> 00:35:34.000
Brother, it's me!

709
00:35:36.000 --> 00:35:39.000
Xiaobao?

710
00:35:40.000 --> 00:35:41.000
You haven't been home for centuries.

711
00:35:41.000 --> 00:35:43.000
I miss you so much.

712
00:35:43.000 --> 00:35:44.000
What are you doing here?

713
00:35:44.000 --> 00:35:46.000
Father sent me to find you.

714
00:35:46.000 --> 00:35:47.000
Look,

715
00:35:47.000 --> 00:35:48.000
the compass you gave me.

716
00:35:48.000 --> 00:35:50.000
It tells me where you are.

717
00:35:50.000 --> 00:35:52.000
Father...

718
00:35:52.000 --> 00:35:53.000
how is he doing?

719
00:35:53.000 --> 00:35:54.000
He's great.

720
00:35:54.000 --> 00:35:56.000
Ever since you entered Yu Xu Palace,

721
00:35:56.000 --> 00:35:58.000
father's been full of energy,

722
00:35:58.000 --> 00:35:59.000
like he took some miracle tonic.

723
00:35:59.000 --> 00:36:01.000
You are the only one from our village ever

724
00:36:01.000 --> 00:36:03.000
made it as a Chan Sect immortal.

725
00:36:03.000 --> 00:36:04.000
Now, fellow demons from miles around

726
00:36:04.000 --> 00:36:06.000
are pouring in to train with father.

727
00:36:08.000 --> 00:36:09.000
By the way,

728
00:36:09.000 --> 00:36:11.000
why are you here?

729
00:36:12.000 --> 00:36:13.000
Didn't you promise me before,

730
00:36:13.000 --> 00:36:14.000
once I've achieved human form,

731
00:36:14.000 --> 00:36:16.000
you'd get me into Yu Xu Palace?

732
00:36:16.000 --> 00:36:19.000
Look! I can turn into a human now!

733
00:36:24.000 --> 00:36:25.000
All these years, I've trained so hard,

734
00:36:25.000 --> 00:36:27.000
never rested a day.

735
00:36:27.000 --> 00:36:29.000
You're my role model, big brother.

736
00:36:29.000 --> 00:36:31.000
Glory to Yu Xu, answering heaven's call.

737
00:36:31.000 --> 00:36:36.000
Travel the world, bringing justice to all.

738
00:36:37.000 --> 00:36:38.000
Say, brother,

739
00:36:38.000 --> 00:36:39.000
what are you doing here?

740
00:36:39.000 --> 00:36:41.000
I... I...

741
00:36:41.000 --> 00:36:43.000
Are these sea monsters your subordinates?

742
00:36:43.000 --> 00:36:45.000
Why are you surrounding Chentang Pass?

743
00:36:45.000 --> 00:36:46.000
Well, about that...

744
00:36:46.000 --> 00:36:48.000
Th... this is...

745
00:36:48.000 --> 00:36:51.000
Master Shen is defending Chentang Pass.

746
00:36:51.000 --> 00:36:52.000
Huh?

747
00:36:52.000 --> 00:36:53.000
Evil forces invaded the city.

748
00:36:53.000 --> 00:36:57.000
Master Shen and the
sea clan came to our aid.

749
00:36:57.000 --> 00:37:01.000
On behalf of my people,
I thank you for this noble act.

750
00:37:02.000 --> 00:37:04.000
Don't mention it.

751
00:37:04.000 --> 00:37:06.000
Wow!

752
00:37:06.000 --> 00:37:08.000
Brother, you're incredible!

753
00:37:08.000 --> 00:37:11.000
Is this the demon attacking Chentang Pass?

754
00:37:11.000 --> 00:37:12.000
Ah!

755
00:37:12.000 --> 00:37:15.000
You are a disgrace to all demons!

756
00:37:15.000 --> 00:37:16.000
Shame on you!

757
00:37:16.000 --> 00:37:17.000
Hey,

758
00:37:17.000 --> 00:37:18.000
Xiaobao,

759
00:37:18.000 --> 00:37:20.000
can you

760
00:37:20.000 --> 00:37:22.000
wait a few more years

761
00:37:22.000 --> 00:37:24.000
before going to Yu Xu Palace?

762
00:37:24.000 --> 00:37:26.000
Why?

763
00:37:26.000 --> 00:37:28.000
I can transform into a human now!

764
00:37:28.000 --> 00:37:29.000
It's just that...

765
00:37:29.000 --> 00:37:32.000
I'm preparing for my promotion
to the Twelve Golden Immortals,

766
00:37:32.000 --> 00:37:33.000
so I can't be distracted.

767
00:37:33.000 --> 00:37:35.000
Twelve Golden Immortals?

768
00:37:35.000 --> 00:37:36.000
Once it's done,

769
00:37:36.000 --> 00:37:38.000
I'll take you there,

770
00:37:38.000 --> 00:37:40.000
okay?

771
00:37:42.000 --> 00:37:43.000
No problem, brother!

772
00:37:43.000 --> 00:37:44.000
Your promotion is more important.

773
00:37:44.000 --> 00:37:47.000
I can go to Yu Xu Palace anytime.

774
00:37:47.000 --> 00:37:49.000
Besides,

775
00:37:49.000 --> 00:37:51.000
I haven't quite mastered
the shape-shifting.

776
00:37:51.000 --> 00:37:52.000
I'll go back and practice more.

777
00:37:52.000 --> 00:37:54.000
More.

778
00:37:57.000 --> 00:37:58.000
Xiaobao,

779
00:37:58.000 --> 00:38:00.000
this is what I've saved up since
I entered the palace.

780
00:38:00.000 --> 00:38:01.000
What is it?

781
00:38:01.000 --> 00:38:04.000
Yu Xu Palace gives all disciples
these immortality pills.

782
00:38:04.000 --> 00:38:05.000
Take one

783
00:38:05.000 --> 00:38:07.000
and you ga... gain ten years' worth
of cultivation.

784
00:38:07.000 --> 00:38:08.000
But...

785
00:38:08.000 --> 00:38:09.000
this is too precious.

786
00:38:09.000 --> 00:38:11.000
Brother, you're training for a promotion.

787
00:38:11.000 --> 00:38:12.000
You should keep them.

788
00:38:12.000 --> 00:38:14.000
I don't like how it tastes.

789
00:38:14.000 --> 00:38:15.000
I prefer cultivating on my own.

790
00:38:15.000 --> 00:38:17.000
You... you should bring them back.

791
00:38:17.000 --> 00:38:19.000
Share them with the family.

792
00:38:19.000 --> 00:38:21.000
Father will blame me.

793
00:38:21.000 --> 00:38:23.000
are you not obeying your big brother?

794
00:38:23.000 --> 00:38:24.000
Take the pills and leave now.

795
00:38:24.000 --> 00:38:26.000
This is the front line.

796
00:38:26.000 --> 00:38:27.000
If... if you stay,

797
00:38:27.000 --> 00:38:28.000
I'll be distracted.

798
00:38:28.000 --> 00:38:30.000
Then...

799
00:38:30.000 --> 00:38:32.000
I...

800
00:38:32.000 --> 00:38:34.000
I'll leave.

801
00:38:36.000 --> 00:38:37.000
Brother.

802
00:38:37.000 --> 00:38:40.000
You must make it into the
Twelve Golden Immortals.

803
00:38:41.000 --> 00:38:44.000
I'll keep training myself.

804
00:38:48.000 --> 00:38:50.000
I appreciate your help,

805
00:38:50.000 --> 00:38:51.000
but the stake is too high

806
00:38:51.000 --> 00:38:52.000
for me to let anyone through.

807
00:38:52.000 --> 00:38:53.000
This Yaksha...

808
00:38:53.000 --> 00:38:55.000
you... you bring him back, too.

809
00:38:55.000 --> 00:38:57.000
I wasn't helping you.

810
00:38:57.000 --> 00:38:59.000
I was helping the young one.

811
00:38:59.000 --> 00:39:01.000
A good role model

812
00:39:01.000 --> 00:39:04.000
can change his life.

813
00:39:05.000 --> 00:39:06.000
Wait.

814
00:39:08.000 --> 00:39:10.000
Le... leave me a list
of medicines you need.

815
00:39:50.000 --> 00:39:53.000
I am Nezha, the Third Prince bold.

816
00:39:53.000 --> 00:39:56.000
I slay the demons, I write in rhyme untold.

817
00:39:56.000 --> 00:39:58.000
Today I come to rid the evil's breath.

818
00:39:58.000 --> 00:40:03.000
You wicked fiends, prepare for death!

819
00:40:06.000 --> 00:40:07.000
Still eating?

820
00:40:07.000 --> 00:40:10.000
You are doomed.

821
00:40:11.000 --> 00:40:13.000
Ahhh!

822
00:40:13.000 --> 00:40:17.000
Who do you think you are?

823
00:40:17.000 --> 00:40:21.000
Barging into our Bandits Hill?

824
00:40:21.000 --> 00:40:22.000
So, you're in charge?

825
00:40:22.000 --> 00:40:25.000
and have a taste of my power.

826
00:40:25.000 --> 00:40:27.000
You arrogant spoilt brat.

827
00:40:27.000 --> 00:40:30.000
teach him a lesson.

828
00:40:47.000 --> 00:40:49.000
Show me what you got.

829
00:40:50.000 --> 00:40:51.000
You go.

830
00:40:51.000 --> 00:40:53.000
No, but, boss...

831
00:40:53.000 --> 00:40:55.000
how dare I steal your thunder?

832
00:40:55.000 --> 00:40:57.000
Fighting a child is just embarrassing.

833
00:40:57.000 --> 00:40:59.000
When I say go, you go.

834
00:40:59.000 --> 00:41:00.000
Hey, kid.

835
00:41:00.000 --> 00:41:01.000
Too young,

836
00:41:01.000 --> 00:41:02.000
too naive.

837
00:41:02.000 --> 00:41:03.000
So, I'm willing to let this slide.

838
00:41:03.000 --> 00:41:04.000
You, you...

839
00:41:04.000 --> 00:41:07.000
It's still not too late to
run home to mommy.

840
00:41:07.000 --> 00:41:08.000
What's wrong?

841
00:41:08.000 --> 00:41:09.000
Why are you awake again?

842
00:41:09.000 --> 00:41:10.000
I don't know.

843
00:41:10.000 --> 00:41:11.000
I'm a light sleeper.

844
00:41:11.000 --> 00:41:13.000
All that shaking has jolted me awake.

845
00:41:13.000 --> 00:41:14.000
Damn it.

846
00:41:14.000 --> 00:41:15.000
He took too much of that pills

847
00:41:15.000 --> 00:41:16.000
and now he's immune.

848
00:41:16.000 --> 00:41:18.000
Increase the dose then.

849
00:41:18.000 --> 00:41:22.000
If you insist to stay you might get hurt.

850
00:41:25.000 --> 00:41:26.000
I was going to dodge to the right.

851
00:41:26.000 --> 00:41:28.000
Sorry, I thought it was left.

852
00:41:30.000 --> 00:41:32.000
So weak.

853
00:41:32.000 --> 00:41:33.000
Maybe I should cut in.

854
00:41:33.000 --> 00:41:35.000
He could use a few more years' training.

855
00:41:35.000 --> 00:41:36.000
Not so fast.

856
00:41:36.000 --> 00:41:38.000
He was just teasing the demon.

857
00:41:38.000 --> 00:41:39.000
The boy likes to...

858
00:41:39.000 --> 00:41:41.000
play dumb.

859
00:41:41.000 --> 00:41:43.000
Pills.

860
00:41:43.000 --> 00:41:46.000
I gave you a warning.

861
00:41:46.000 --> 00:41:48.000
Now you know who you're messing with.

862
00:41:48.000 --> 00:41:49.000
Oh no.

863
00:41:49.000 --> 00:41:51.000
The pills have dissolved in the soup!

864
00:41:51.000 --> 00:41:54.000
Then I'll drink the soup.

865
00:41:55.000 --> 00:41:56.000
And you're trying to steal our soup?

866
00:41:56.000 --> 00:41:59.000
This calls for a beating.

867
00:41:59.000 --> 00:42:02.000
Let me.

868
00:42:03.000 --> 00:42:04.000
So gross.

869
00:42:04.000 --> 00:42:09.000
Super Mighty Club Strike!

870
00:42:12.000 --> 00:42:14.000
I told you he was pretending.

871
00:42:14.000 --> 00:42:16.000
I wasn't paying attention.

872
00:42:16.000 --> 00:42:18.000
That didn't count.

873
00:42:33.000 --> 00:42:37.000
Not possible!

874
00:42:41.000 --> 00:42:43.000
You suck!

875
00:42:43.000 --> 00:42:44.000
Step aside!

876
00:42:44.000 --> 00:42:46.000
Watch me kick his butt.

877
00:42:46.000 --> 00:42:47.000
Why did you spit it all out?

878
00:42:47.000 --> 00:42:48.000
The taste is too strong.

879
00:42:48.000 --> 00:42:49.000
I couldn't help it.

880
00:42:49.000 --> 00:42:52.000
Check this out!

881
00:42:54.000 --> 00:42:55.000
Funny!

882
00:42:55.000 --> 00:42:56.000
This isn't working.

883
00:42:56.000 --> 00:42:58.000
We can't win without the pill.

884
00:43:06.000 --> 00:43:07.000
Deero is watching.

885
00:43:07.000 --> 00:43:08.000
I can't give you the pill.

886
00:43:08.000 --> 00:43:09.000
What do we do now?

887
00:43:09.000 --> 00:43:11.000
I got it.

888
00:43:11.000 --> 00:43:13.000
There is another way.

889
00:43:13.000 --> 00:43:14.000
You're not suggesting...

890
00:43:14.000 --> 00:43:16.000
We can eat the puke.

891
00:43:16.000 --> 00:43:17.000
But,

892
00:43:17.000 --> 00:43:19.000
it's disgusting.

893
00:43:19.000 --> 00:43:20.000
What's the big deal?

894
00:43:20.000 --> 00:43:23.000
Remember when I drank Yaksha booger?

895
00:43:23.000 --> 00:43:24.000
This explains a lot.

896
00:43:24.000 --> 00:43:26.000
No pains

897
00:43:26.000 --> 00:43:28.000
no gains.

898
00:43:28.000 --> 00:43:31.000
That's how Nezha defeat fate.

899
00:43:31.000 --> 00:43:35.000
Lives of my parents
and friends are at stake,

900
00:43:35.000 --> 00:43:38.000
and the people of Chentang Pass.

901
00:43:38.000 --> 00:43:43.000
E-A-S-Y P-E-A-S-Y!

902
00:43:49.000 --> 00:43:51.000
With ignoring prejudice

903
00:43:51.000 --> 00:43:53.000
and overcoming inner fears

904
00:43:53.000 --> 00:43:57.000
I will change my destiny.

905
00:44:14.000 --> 00:44:17.000
I kept low-key

906
00:44:17.000 --> 00:44:19.000
until today's show.

907
00:44:19.000 --> 00:44:20.000
Master Taiyi.

908
00:44:20.000 --> 00:44:21.000
Save Nezha first.

909
00:44:21.000 --> 00:44:23.000
Then we'll figure out
a way for Elixir Reparo.

910
00:44:23.000 --> 00:44:24.000
No way.

911
00:44:24.000 --> 00:44:26.000
I don't believe this.

912
00:44:26.000 --> 00:44:29.000
let's do another round.

913
00:44:29.000 --> 00:44:30.000
Fake death?

914
00:44:30.000 --> 00:44:34.000
I'll smash you!

915
00:44:40.000 --> 00:44:42.000
Good thing Nezha got knocked out.

916
00:44:42.000 --> 00:44:46.000
You do suck!

917
00:44:46.000 --> 00:44:47.000
Let me avenge you!

918
00:44:47.000 --> 00:44:52.000
Invincible Whirlwind Punch!

919
00:45:05.000 --> 00:45:07.000
Ahhh!

920
00:45:24.000 --> 00:45:25.000
Do we have to catch them all?

921
00:45:25.000 --> 00:45:26.000
Even leaving one behind

922
00:45:26.000 --> 00:45:27.000
could harm the people here.

923
00:45:27.000 --> 00:45:29.000
Take them all back to Yu Xu Palace.

924
00:45:29.000 --> 00:45:31.000
The Sect will guide them to the right path,

925
00:45:31.000 --> 00:45:33.000
turning evil to good.

926
00:45:33.000 --> 00:45:34.000
What's with the face?

927
00:45:34.000 --> 00:45:35.000
No biggy.

928
00:45:35.000 --> 00:45:37.000
His look switches from time to time.

929
00:45:37.000 --> 00:45:38.000
Spirit Pearl, you know,

930
00:45:38.000 --> 00:45:40.000
not like normal people.

931
00:45:40.000 --> 00:45:42.000
Be more careful next time,

932
00:45:42.000 --> 00:45:45.000
you scared my soul out.

933
00:45:55.000 --> 00:45:56.000
Who's this kid?

934
00:45:56.000 --> 00:45:57.000
Nezha, possibly.

935
00:45:57.000 --> 00:45:58.000
Younger brother of Jinzha and Muzha.

936
00:45:58.000 --> 00:46:02.000
He's the Spirit Pearl reincarnation
appointed by the Supreme Lord.

937
00:46:03.000 --> 00:46:06.000
Not likely, huh?

938
00:46:06.000 --> 00:46:07.000
Hunched back.

939
00:46:07.000 --> 00:46:08.000
Wobbly pace.

940
00:46:08.000 --> 00:46:10.000
Sinking brows and drooping eyes.

941
00:46:10.000 --> 00:46:11.000
Disgusting face.

942
00:46:11.000 --> 00:46:12.000
Not to mention the dark eye circles.

943
00:46:12.000 --> 00:46:14.000
More like a ghost.

944
00:46:20.000 --> 00:46:23.000
Not now.

945
00:46:29.000 --> 00:46:31.000
Brother,

946
00:46:31.000 --> 00:46:33.000
what's the star sign tonight?

947
00:46:33.000 --> 00:46:35.000
Six stars in alignment,

948
00:46:35.000 --> 00:46:37.000
once in a decade.

949
00:46:37.000 --> 00:46:39.000
Whenever six stars align,

950
00:46:39.000 --> 00:46:43.000
this Jade Podium can transmit sound
and images across thousands of miles.

951
00:46:43.000 --> 00:46:45.000
Our brothers scatter all over the world

952
00:46:45.000 --> 00:46:47.000
and finally get together.

953
00:46:47.000 --> 00:46:50.000
Tonight is the night,

954
00:46:50.000 --> 00:46:53.000
the Golden Immortals shall meet.

955
00:46:53.000 --> 00:46:55.000
I haven't ascended to the Twelve yet.

956
00:46:55.000 --> 00:46:57.000
Maybe I shouldn't be included.

957
00:46:57.000 --> 00:46:58.000
It's only a matter of time.

958
00:46:58.000 --> 00:47:00.000
No la, no la.

959
00:47:00.000 --> 00:47:01.000
It's not appropriate at all.

960
00:47:01.000 --> 00:47:03.000
I can't do it, really.

961
00:47:03.000 --> 00:47:04.000
Then why are you sitting up there?

962
00:47:04.000 --> 00:47:05.000
Shut up!

963
00:47:05.000 --> 00:47:08.000
Would it kill you to
see your master thrive?

964
00:47:16.000 --> 00:47:17.000
A Sauna!

965
00:47:17.000 --> 00:47:19.000
Shh!

966
00:47:25.000 --> 00:47:28.000
Brothers and sisters,
I humbly welcome you back to your places.

967
00:47:28.000 --> 00:47:30.000
Greetings, Brother Wuliang!

968
00:47:30.000 --> 00:47:33.000
Allow me to introduce a new member.

969
00:47:33.000 --> 00:47:34.000
Brother Taiyi.

970
00:47:34.000 --> 00:47:37.000
He has fulfilled the master's expectations

971
00:47:37.000 --> 00:47:39.000
and successfully nurtured

972
00:47:39.000 --> 00:47:41.000
the Spirit Pearl reincarnation.

973
00:47:42.000 --> 00:47:45.000
Pay your respect.

974
00:47:46.000 --> 00:47:49.000
The Deification War is imminent.

975
00:47:49.000 --> 00:47:53.000
We are here to discuss the preparation.

976
00:47:53.000 --> 00:47:56.000
Chan Sect is the orthodox of Tao,

977
00:47:56.000 --> 00:47:57.000
so we're destined to win.

978
00:47:57.000 --> 00:47:59.000
But as Jie Sect has
risen rapidly these years,

979
00:47:59.000 --> 00:48:02.000
we must remain vigilant.

980
00:48:02.000 --> 00:48:03.000
Jie Sect,

981
00:48:03.000 --> 00:48:05.000
is where furry and horny beasts gather

982
00:48:05.000 --> 00:48:07.000
and creatures born of mucus and eggs.

983
00:48:07.000 --> 00:48:09.000
This war concerns the survival of our sect.

984
00:48:09.000 --> 00:48:10.000
We must be careful.

985
00:48:10.000 --> 00:48:12.000
Strengthening our power

986
00:48:12.000 --> 00:48:13.000
is the key.

987
00:48:13.000 --> 00:48:15.000
Precisely.

988
00:48:15.000 --> 00:48:19.000
That's why I began preparing early.

989
00:48:19.000 --> 00:48:20.000
Immortality pills,

990
00:48:20.000 --> 00:48:22.000
a total of nine thousands.

991
00:48:22.000 --> 00:48:26.000
Could be allocated according to grades.

992
00:48:26.000 --> 00:48:28.000
This will definitely boost our strength.

993
00:48:28.000 --> 00:48:29.000
How could be so many?

994
00:48:29.000 --> 00:48:31.000
For a hundred years,

995
00:48:31.000 --> 00:48:33.000
our master has tirelessly refined pills
with the Tianyuan Cauldron,

996
00:48:33.000 --> 00:48:35.000
working day and night,

997
00:48:35.000 --> 00:48:36.000
at the cost of his own cultivating.

998
00:48:36.000 --> 00:48:40.000
Brother Wuliang has dedicated himself
to building our sect,

999
00:48:40.000 --> 00:48:42.000
his contributions are to be praised.

1000
00:48:42.000 --> 00:48:45.000
Aye, aye.

1001
00:48:45.000 --> 00:48:46.000
Besides the Jie Sect,

1002
00:48:46.000 --> 00:48:48.000
are there other evil
forces plotting against us?

1003
00:48:48.000 --> 00:48:49.000
Master Cihang,

1004
00:48:49.000 --> 00:48:51.000
as soon as menacing demons are discovered,

1005
00:48:51.000 --> 00:48:53.000
the Demon Hunters will
immediately be sent out.

1006
00:48:53.000 --> 00:48:55.000
So, most stray demons pose no threat.

1007
00:48:55.000 --> 00:48:56.000
But,

1008
00:48:56.000 --> 00:48:58.000
there is one exception.

1009
00:48:58.000 --> 00:49:00.000
Who is that?

1010
00:49:00.000 --> 00:49:02.000
The Eastern Sea Loongs.

1011
00:49:02.000 --> 00:49:04.000
Loongs?

1012
00:49:04.000 --> 00:49:07.000
Didn't they surrender to the Court
of Heaven long ago?

1013
00:49:07.000 --> 00:49:09.000
No kind could be trusted
except for our own.

1014
00:49:09.000 --> 00:49:10.000
To me,

1015
00:49:10.000 --> 00:49:13.000
their surrender is merely a facade,

1016
00:49:13.000 --> 00:49:14.000
hibernating for a moment.

1017
00:49:14.000 --> 00:49:17.000
The Loongs have helped subdue the
abyss monsters for thousands of years.

1018
00:49:17.000 --> 00:49:18.000
What's their crime?

1019
00:49:18.000 --> 00:49:20.000
But they own great strength.

1020
00:49:20.000 --> 00:49:22.000
If they betray us in the war,

1021
00:49:22.000 --> 00:49:25.000
the whole situation could be overturned.

1022
00:49:26.000 --> 00:49:27.000
But we still can't do that.

1023
00:49:27.000 --> 00:49:30.000
Our reputation of righteous
and just is known to all.

1024
00:49:30.000 --> 00:49:32.000
If we gratuitously

1025
00:49:32.000 --> 00:49:34.000
attack the surrendered,

1026
00:49:34.000 --> 00:49:37.000
how will anyone ever trust us?

1027
00:49:37.000 --> 00:49:38.000
Aye.

1028
00:49:38.000 --> 00:49:40.000
We must not act rashly.

1029
00:49:40.000 --> 00:49:43.000
Further deliberation is necessary.

1030
00:49:43.000 --> 00:49:44.000
Enough.

1031
00:49:44.000 --> 00:49:46.000
They made their points.

1032
00:49:46.000 --> 00:49:48.000
And you don't have to be bigoted.

1033
00:49:48.000 --> 00:49:49.000
OK.

1034
00:49:49.000 --> 00:49:51.000
The time of the six-star
alignment is almost over.

1035
00:49:51.000 --> 00:49:54.000
Since there are no other topics,

1036
00:49:54.000 --> 00:49:57.000
let's adjourn the meeting.

1037
00:49:57.000 --> 00:49:58.000
Brother,

1038
00:49:58.000 --> 00:49:59.000
Jinzha and Muzha

1039
00:49:59.000 --> 00:50:02.000
are disciples of myself and Brother Puxian.

1040
00:50:02.000 --> 00:50:04.000
They have been cultivating here
for many years away from home,

1041
00:50:04.000 --> 00:50:06.000
never even met Nezha,

1042
00:50:06.000 --> 00:50:07.000
their younger brother.

1043
00:50:07.000 --> 00:50:10.000
Since there's still time left
in the six-star alignment,

1044
00:50:10.000 --> 00:50:12.000
why not let them

1045
00:50:12.000 --> 00:50:15.000
meet for a while?

1046
00:50:15.000 --> 00:50:17.000
Great idea.

1047
00:50:23.000 --> 00:50:24.000
OMG!

1048
00:50:24.000 --> 00:50:26.000
What should I do?

1049
00:50:26.000 --> 00:50:28.000
What?

1050
00:50:28.000 --> 00:50:29.000
Speaking of my look...

1051
00:50:29.000 --> 00:50:31.000
Will my first impression...

1052
00:50:31.000 --> 00:50:32.000
Be bad?

1053
00:50:32.000 --> 00:50:33.000
Of course not!

1054
00:50:33.000 --> 00:50:34.000
Really?

1055
00:50:34.000 --> 00:50:35.000
Though slovenly,

1056
00:50:35.000 --> 00:50:36.000
you've got strong will.

1057
00:50:36.000 --> 00:50:37.000
Though short,

1058
00:50:37.000 --> 00:50:38.000
you've got a big heart.

1059
00:50:38.000 --> 00:50:39.000
Though ugly,

1060
00:50:39.000 --> 00:50:40.000
you're kind inside.

1061
00:50:40.000 --> 00:50:41.000
Though you have black eye circles,

1062
00:50:41.000 --> 00:50:42.000
piggy nose

1063
00:50:42.000 --> 00:50:43.000
I still think

1064
00:50:43.000 --> 00:50:46.000
you're truly incredibly great.

1065
00:50:46.000 --> 00:50:49.000
And I'm sure your brothers would agree.

1066
00:50:49.000 --> 00:50:52.000
Thanks for the compliment.

1067
00:50:52.000 --> 00:50:53.000
What are you doing?

1068
00:50:53.000 --> 00:50:54.000
You go meet my brothers for me.

1069
00:50:54.000 --> 00:50:55.000
Seriously?

1070
00:50:55.000 --> 00:50:56.000
How can I do this for you?

1071
00:50:56.000 --> 00:50:57.000
No, Nezha.

1072
00:50:57.000 --> 00:50:59.000
Nezha!

1073
00:51:05.000 --> 00:51:07.000
The boy is a bit shy.

1074
00:51:11.000 --> 00:51:13.000
Nezha!

1075
00:51:13.000 --> 00:51:15.000
Brother!

1076
00:51:39.000 --> 00:51:40.000
Ao Bing,

1077
00:51:40.000 --> 00:51:43.000
you cried?

1078
00:51:43.000 --> 00:51:45.000
This reminded me of my two brothers.

1079
00:51:45.000 --> 00:51:47.000
You have brothers too?

1080
00:51:47.000 --> 00:51:48.000
Mm.

1081
00:51:48.000 --> 00:51:50.000
I used to.

1082
00:51:50.000 --> 00:51:52.000
Having two such wonderful brothers.

1083
00:51:52.000 --> 00:51:54.000
You're so lucky.

1084
00:51:54.000 --> 00:51:57.000
What were you talking about just now?

1085
00:51:57.000 --> 00:51:59.000
They said

1086
00:51:59.000 --> 00:52:01.000
they're sorry for not checking
on you all these years.

1087
00:52:01.000 --> 00:52:03.000
They asked

1088
00:52:03.000 --> 00:52:05.000
how things have been at home,

1089
00:52:05.000 --> 00:52:06.000
if your parents are well,

1090
00:52:06.000 --> 00:52:07.000
what hobbies you have,

1091
00:52:07.000 --> 00:52:09.000
and who your friends are.

1092
00:52:09.000 --> 00:52:10.000
They also said

1093
00:52:10.000 --> 00:52:12.000
that whatever problems
you may have in the future,

1094
00:52:12.000 --> 00:52:13.000
go to them.

1095
00:52:13.000 --> 00:52:16.000
And remember, you have two brothers

1096
00:52:16.000 --> 00:52:19.000
who will always help and protect you.

1097
00:52:19.000 --> 00:52:20.000
Why are you...

1098
00:52:20.000 --> 00:52:21.000
Nothing.

1099
00:52:21.000 --> 00:52:23.000
It's just sand in my eyes.

1100
00:52:24.000 --> 00:52:25.000
You sure it's not the other way around?

1101
00:52:25.000 --> 00:52:26.000
Shut up!

1102
00:52:26.000 --> 00:52:27.000
I said nothing.

1103
00:52:27.000 --> 00:52:29.000
OK. You are the boss here.

1104
00:52:33.000 --> 00:52:35.000
I'm not talking to you.

1105
00:52:35.000 --> 00:52:36.000
Fine,

1106
00:52:36.000 --> 00:52:38.000
I'll stop.

1107
00:52:40.000 --> 00:52:41.000
Are you still mad?

1108
00:52:41.000 --> 00:52:42.000
Nezha?

1109
00:52:42.000 --> 00:52:43.000
Nezha!

1110
00:52:43.000 --> 00:52:45.000
Ao Bing,

1111
00:52:46.000 --> 00:52:48.000
I've been violent and
unruly since I was young,

1112
00:52:48.000 --> 00:52:51.000
making my parents worry all day.

1113
00:52:51.000 --> 00:52:52.000
Your father,

1114
00:52:52.000 --> 00:52:54.000
though he attacked Chentang Pass,

1115
00:52:54.000 --> 00:52:56.000
I know he only risk everything

1116
00:52:56.000 --> 00:52:58.000
for your sake.

1117
00:52:58.000 --> 00:52:59.000
And today,

1118
00:52:59.000 --> 00:53:03.000
my brothers were so kind to me.

1119
00:53:03.000 --> 00:53:05.000
Our families have
sacrificed so much for us.

1120
00:53:05.000 --> 00:53:06.000
You're a monster,

1121
00:53:06.000 --> 00:53:08.000
and I'm a demon.

1122
00:53:08.000 --> 00:53:10.000
We're both burdens for our families.

1123
00:53:12.000 --> 00:53:14.000
So what if we were born as demons?

1124
00:53:14.000 --> 00:53:17.000
Immortal or demon, I make the choice.

1125
00:53:17.000 --> 00:53:18.000
Once you are saved,

1126
00:53:18.000 --> 00:53:19.000
we must win ourselves a
place among the immortals

1127
00:53:19.000 --> 00:53:20.000
so our families won't
have to worry anymore.

1128
00:53:20.000 --> 00:53:21.000
Yes!

1129
00:53:21.000 --> 00:53:22.000
Only by becoming immortals

1130
00:53:22.000 --> 00:53:24.000
can we have everyone's respect.

1131
00:53:24.000 --> 00:53:25.000
Deal!

1132
00:53:25.000 --> 00:53:29.000
I'm going to become an immortal!

1133
00:53:34.000 --> 00:53:37.000
Only with courage and diligence
can great progress be made.

1134
00:53:37.000 --> 00:53:39.000
At this speed,

1135
00:53:39.000 --> 00:53:42.000
hundred years would still be in vain.

1136
00:53:42.000 --> 00:53:43.000
About cultivating,

1137
00:53:43.000 --> 00:53:46.000
the priorities are
vitality, energy, and spirit.

1138
00:53:46.000 --> 00:53:47.000
If feeling hard,

1139
00:53:47.000 --> 00:53:48.000
or exhausted,

1140
00:53:48.000 --> 00:53:52.000
it's because you were born demons.

1141
00:53:52.000 --> 00:53:53.000
Only by giving it your all

1142
00:53:53.000 --> 00:53:56.000
you will have a chance
to change your destiny

1143
00:53:56.000 --> 00:53:58.000
and achieve immortality.

1144
00:53:59.000 --> 00:54:02.000
Life or death, of none I'm scared,

1145
00:54:02.000 --> 00:54:05.000
defying authority is what I've revered.

1146
00:54:05.000 --> 00:54:08.000
My fate is mine, not heaven's plan.

1147
00:54:08.000 --> 00:54:12.000
This bad boy will become a godly man!

1148
00:54:12.000 --> 00:54:15.000
Bravo!

1149
00:54:15.000 --> 00:54:17.000
Just a few lines, yet so powerful,

1150
00:54:17.000 --> 00:54:19.000
truly inspiring.

1151
00:54:19.000 --> 00:54:21.000
A great poem, indeed.

1152
00:54:21.000 --> 00:54:25.000
This is something all
of you should learn from.

1153
00:54:25.000 --> 00:54:26.000
Really?

1154
00:54:26.000 --> 00:54:28.000
Is it that good?

1155
00:54:28.000 --> 00:54:29.000
I just made it up.

1156
00:54:29.000 --> 00:54:30.000
It is good.

1157
00:54:30.000 --> 00:54:31.000
Every word counts,

1158
00:54:31.000 --> 00:54:32.000
and encouraging.

1159
00:54:32.000 --> 00:54:34.000
A poem like this

1160
00:54:34.000 --> 00:54:36.000
shows the ambition of you, young man.

1161
00:54:36.000 --> 00:54:37.000
A true young hero

1162
00:54:37.000 --> 00:54:39.000
with a bright future ahead!

1163
00:54:39.000 --> 00:54:40.000
Oh, come on. It's just fine.

1164
00:54:40.000 --> 00:54:42.000
Actually, it still has some tiny flaws.

1165
00:54:42.000 --> 00:54:43.000
More like plenty of flaws.

1166
00:54:43.000 --> 00:54:44.000
Let me ask you,

1167
00:54:44.000 --> 00:54:45.000
what's with those dark eye circles?

1168
00:54:45.000 --> 00:54:48.000
It's obvious you stay up late all the time.

1169
00:54:48.000 --> 00:54:49.000
Your life is undisciplined,

1170
00:54:49.000 --> 00:54:50.000
your diet unhealthy,

1171
00:54:50.000 --> 00:54:51.000
and you can't even
manage basic self-control.

1172
00:54:51.000 --> 00:54:53.000
How dare you dream of becoming an immortal?

1173
00:54:53.000 --> 00:54:55.000
I was born with dark eye circles.

1174
00:54:55.000 --> 00:54:56.000
Appearance reflects the
heart, don't you know?

1175
00:54:56.000 --> 00:54:58.000
Take a look at yourself in the mirror.

1176
00:54:58.000 --> 00:54:59.000
reckless and sloppy.

1177
00:54:59.000 --> 00:55:00.000
If you were my disciple,

1178
00:55:00.000 --> 00:55:02.000
I'd make you rebuild your human form.

1179
00:55:02.000 --> 00:55:03.000
Can be rebuilt?

1180
00:55:03.000 --> 00:55:05.000
Then there's hope for my looks, right?

1181
00:55:05.000 --> 00:55:06.000
Teach me, please.

1182
00:55:06.000 --> 00:55:07.000
I knew you came to find yourself a master.

1183
00:55:07.000 --> 00:55:08.000
Listen, kid,

1184
00:55:08.000 --> 00:55:10.000
I see you have great ambition,

1185
00:55:10.000 --> 00:55:12.000
so I'll take you as my disciple.

1186
00:55:12.000 --> 00:55:15.000
Master!

1187
00:55:15.000 --> 00:55:16.000
Come,

1188
00:55:16.000 --> 00:55:17.000
train with your brothers.

1189
00:55:17.000 --> 00:55:18.000
Train for what?

1190
00:55:18.000 --> 00:55:19.000
Immortality, of course.

1191
00:55:19.000 --> 00:55:20.000
I don't need you to teach me that.

1192
00:55:20.000 --> 00:55:21.000
Show me how to be prettier.

1193
00:55:21.000 --> 00:55:23.000
You're putting looks before cultivation?

1194
00:55:23.000 --> 00:55:25.000
Get your priorities straight.

1195
00:55:25.000 --> 00:55:26.000
Are you teaching me or not?

1196
00:55:26.000 --> 00:55:28.000
We're no longer master and disciple.

1197
00:55:28.000 --> 00:55:30.000
You deserve to have panda eyes for life.

1198
00:55:30.000 --> 00:55:31.000
That's too much.

1199
00:55:31.000 --> 00:55:33.000
I was going to go easy on you!

1200
00:55:33.000 --> 00:55:34.000
Are you challenging me?

1201
00:55:34.000 --> 00:55:35.000
Three pills should be enough.

1202
00:55:35.000 --> 00:55:36.000
Kid,

1203
00:55:36.000 --> 00:55:38.000
go back where you came from.

1204
00:55:38.000 --> 00:55:40.000
If you keep disrupting our class,

1205
00:55:40.000 --> 00:55:43.000
this could end badly for you.

1206
00:55:43.000 --> 00:55:45.000
Apologies.

1207
00:56:21.000 --> 00:56:24.000
You're no match for me.

1208
00:56:24.000 --> 00:56:26.000
Impressive, kid.

1209
00:56:26.000 --> 00:56:29.000
I underestimated you.

1210
00:56:42.000 --> 00:56:44.000
Try this!

1211
00:56:46.000 --> 00:56:48.000
Yeah, teach this ignorant brat a lesson.

1212
00:56:48.000 --> 00:56:49.000
Master will surely win!

1213
00:56:49.000 --> 00:56:50.000
So fast!

1214
00:56:50.000 --> 00:56:52.000
You saw it?

1215
00:56:54.000 --> 00:56:55.000
We have no grudges between us.

1216
00:56:55.000 --> 00:56:57.000
You'd better go.

1217
00:56:57.000 --> 00:56:59.000
I cannot lose.

1218
00:57:09.000 --> 00:57:11.000
You can't even touch me.

1219
00:57:11.000 --> 00:57:13.000
Let alone fight.

1220
00:57:25.000 --> 00:57:26.000
Hold him tight.

1221
00:57:26.000 --> 00:57:28.000
Speedy is junky.

1222
00:57:28.000 --> 00:57:30.000
Surrender?

1223
00:57:41.000 --> 00:57:44.000
Wait, you are...

1224
00:57:44.000 --> 00:57:45.000
You've figured it out finally.

1225
00:57:45.000 --> 00:57:46.000
I'm not fast.

1226
00:57:46.000 --> 00:57:48.000
I just transform into electric currents,

1227
00:57:48.000 --> 00:57:50.000
traveling instantly to any location.

1228
00:57:50.000 --> 00:57:51.000
In water,

1229
00:57:51.000 --> 00:57:55.000
I am invincible!

1230
00:58:08.000 --> 00:58:11.000
Impressive cryo power.

1231
00:58:13.000 --> 00:58:14.000
Stay calm.

1232
00:58:14.000 --> 00:58:16.000
Try too hard and your body will collapse!

1233
00:58:16.000 --> 00:58:17.000
Ice doesn't conduct electricity.

1234
00:58:17.000 --> 00:58:20.000
Let's see what else you've got.

1235
00:58:20.000 --> 00:58:21.000
Lakes and seas...

1236
00:58:21.000 --> 00:58:22.000
By this divine talisman in my hand.

1237
00:58:22.000 --> 00:58:23.000
Wind is to rise and rain is to fall.

1238
00:58:23.000 --> 00:58:26.000
Swift and Uplift!

1239
00:58:36.000 --> 00:58:38.000
Father!

1240
00:58:44.000 --> 00:58:45.000
Damn it.

1241
00:58:45.000 --> 00:58:46.000
The Rain Summoning Spell.

1242
00:58:46.000 --> 00:58:48.000
End this now!

1243
00:59:00.000 --> 00:59:02.000
Too late.

1244
00:59:16.000 --> 00:59:18.000
You're doomed.

1245
00:59:36.000 --> 00:59:38.000
Master!

1246
00:59:38.000 --> 00:59:39.000
Master, are you all right?

1247
00:59:39.000 --> 00:59:41.000
I wasn't going to take your life.

1248
00:59:41.000 --> 00:59:42.000
You didn't have to sacrifice an arm.

1249
00:59:42.000 --> 00:59:44.000
All disciples, listen,

1250
00:59:44.000 --> 00:59:46.000
take the demons back to the palace.

1251
00:59:46.000 --> 00:59:48.000
Yes!

1252
00:59:48.000 --> 00:59:49.000
Stop!

1253
00:59:49.000 --> 00:59:50.000
Put them down.

1254
00:59:50.000 --> 00:59:51.000
All of you, put them down!

1255
00:59:51.000 --> 00:59:54.000
May I ask if you are a
member of the Chan Sect?

1256
00:59:54.000 --> 00:59:55.000
That's correct.

1257
00:59:55.000 --> 00:59:57.000
Ah.

1258
01:00:02.000 --> 01:00:04.000
These are all immortals from Yu Xu Palace.

1259
01:00:04.000 --> 01:00:06.000
You must not be disrespectful.

1260
01:00:06.000 --> 01:00:07.000
Entering Yu Xu Palace

1261
01:00:07.000 --> 01:00:09.000
and receiving the teachings
of the righteous path

1262
01:00:09.000 --> 01:00:11.000
may not be a bad thing.

1263
01:00:11.000 --> 01:00:14.000
All of you, drop your weapons!

1264
01:00:22.000 --> 01:00:23.000
Father!

1265
01:00:23.000 --> 01:00:24.000
Xiaobao?

1266
01:00:24.000 --> 01:00:26.000
How come you're back?

1267
01:00:31.000 --> 01:00:32.000
Xiaobao,

1268
01:00:32.000 --> 01:00:34.000
stand down!

1269
01:00:40.000 --> 01:00:42.000
Xiaobao!

1270
01:00:47.000 --> 01:00:48.000
Demon!

1271
01:00:48.000 --> 01:00:51.000
How dare you!

1272
01:00:51.000 --> 01:00:53.000
No!

1273
01:01:06.000 --> 01:01:08.000
Father!

1274
01:01:11.000 --> 01:01:14.000
freeze the river now!

1275
01:01:25.000 --> 01:01:28.000
You can't escape!

1276
01:01:46.000 --> 01:01:47.000
Father!

1277
01:01:47.000 --> 01:01:48.000
Go!

1278
01:01:48.000 --> 01:01:50.000
Go now!

1279
01:01:50.000 --> 01:01:52.000
Run!

1280
01:01:52.000 --> 01:01:54.000
Father...

1281
01:02:00.000 --> 01:02:02.000
There's no escape.

1282
01:02:03.000 --> 01:02:04.000
Step aside.

1283
01:02:04.000 --> 01:02:06.000
He's just trying to save his father.

1284
01:02:06.000 --> 01:02:08.000
You didn't have to be so brutal.

1285
01:02:11.000 --> 01:02:13.000
Hmph.

1286
01:02:17.000 --> 01:02:19.000
Panax notoginseng,

1287
01:02:19.000 --> 01:02:20.000
cattail pollen,

1288
01:02:20.000 --> 01:02:22.000
munjeet,

1289
01:02:22.000 --> 01:02:24.000
borneol,

1290
01:02:24.000 --> 01:02:25.000
Loong's blood.

1291
01:02:25.000 --> 01:02:26.000
One more basket.

1292
01:02:26.000 --> 01:02:27.000
Safflower,

1293
01:02:27.000 --> 01:02:29.000
angelica,

1294
01:02:29.000 --> 01:02:30.000
pseudo-ginseng powder,

1295
01:02:30.000 --> 01:02:32.000
sappanwood,

1296
01:02:32.000 --> 01:02:33.000
poison nut.

1297
01:02:33.000 --> 01:02:34.000
My lord,

1298
01:02:34.000 --> 01:02:36.000
we now have everything on the list,

1299
01:02:36.000 --> 01:02:39.000
along with a hundred
baskets of sea products.

1300
01:02:39.000 --> 01:02:42.000
We happen to be short on food supplies.

1301
01:02:44.000 --> 01:02:46.000
Master Shen, a moment, please.

1302
01:02:46.000 --> 01:02:48.000
We've prepared a meal.

1303
01:02:48.000 --> 01:02:51.000
Would you honor us with your presence?

1304
01:02:55.000 --> 01:02:57.000
You...

1305
01:02:57.000 --> 01:02:59.000
Thanks to Lord Li's kindness,

1306
01:02:59.000 --> 01:03:01.000
I've been taken in as a servant.

1307
01:03:01.000 --> 01:03:02.000
He may be a demon,

1308
01:03:02.000 --> 01:03:04.000
but he has a good heart.

1309
01:03:04.000 --> 01:03:05.000
As long as he behaves,

1310
01:03:05.000 --> 01:03:08.000
there's no reason he can't have a future.

1311
01:03:08.000 --> 01:03:10.000
I wonder if the dishes suit your taste.

1312
01:03:10.000 --> 01:03:12.000
Not...

1313
01:03:12.000 --> 01:03:13.000
Not bad.

1314
01:03:13.000 --> 01:03:14.000
Then have some more.

1315
01:03:14.000 --> 01:03:16.000
Try this liquor as well.

1316
01:03:16.000 --> 01:03:17.000
I quit long ago.

1317
01:03:17.000 --> 01:03:20.000
Cultivators must sup... suppress desires.

1318
01:03:20.000 --> 01:03:22.000
As the saying goes,

1319
01:03:22.000 --> 01:03:24.000
one must cut off urges
to perfect the spirit.

1320
01:03:24.000 --> 01:03:25.000
Another saying goes,

1321
01:03:25.000 --> 01:03:29.000
one must practice
kindness to polish virtue.

1322
01:03:29.000 --> 01:03:30.000
Talking won't help.

1323
01:03:30.000 --> 01:03:33.000
I've already re... reached
the point of no return.

1324
01:03:33.000 --> 01:03:36.000
You can't hide forever.

1325
01:03:36.000 --> 01:03:39.000
The truth will come out one day.

1326
01:03:39.000 --> 01:03:40.000
If you continue to harm lives

1327
01:03:40.000 --> 01:03:41.000
making more mistakes,

1328
01:03:41.000 --> 01:03:43.000
even if you can deceive everyone,

1329
01:03:43.000 --> 01:03:45.000
you won't be able to fool yourself.

1330
01:03:45.000 --> 01:03:48.000
And you will not improve further
on your cultivation,

1331
01:03:48.000 --> 01:03:50.000
the essence of which

1332
01:03:50.000 --> 01:03:51.000
is doing good deeds

1333
01:03:51.000 --> 01:03:52.000
and walking the righteous path.

1334
01:03:52.000 --> 01:03:54.000
What nonsense!

1335
01:03:54.000 --> 01:03:55.000
You know nothing

1336
01:03:55.000 --> 01:03:57.000
about cultivation.

1337
01:04:04.000 --> 01:04:06.000
Sir!

1338
01:04:06.000 --> 01:04:09.000
Someone is here to see Master Shen.

1339
01:04:16.000 --> 01:04:18.000
Brother.

1340
01:04:18.000 --> 01:04:19.000
Who did this to you?

1341
01:04:19.000 --> 01:04:21.000
Some Taoists.

1342
01:04:21.000 --> 01:04:25.000
They attacked.

1343
01:04:25.000 --> 01:04:27.000
Father...

1344
01:04:27.000 --> 01:04:29.000
had one of his arms

1345
01:04:29.000 --> 01:04:31.000
cut off.

1346
01:04:31.000 --> 01:04:33.000
Who did it?

1347
01:04:33.000 --> 01:04:36.000
His name is...

1348
01:04:36.000 --> 01:04:38.000
Ne...

1349
01:04:38.000 --> 01:04:41.000
Zha.

1350
01:04:55.000 --> 01:04:58.000
Congratulations on passing Level 2.

1351
01:04:58.000 --> 01:04:59.000
Please inform Brother Wuliang.

1352
01:04:59.000 --> 01:05:02.000
Master is in seclusion refining pills

1353
01:05:02.000 --> 01:05:03.000
and has not emerged yet.

1354
01:05:03.000 --> 01:05:05.000
Before Level 3,

1355
01:05:05.000 --> 01:05:07.000
why don't you rest for a few days?

1356
01:05:07.000 --> 01:05:08.000
We only have two days left.

1357
01:05:08.000 --> 01:05:09.000
No need.

1358
01:05:09.000 --> 01:05:10.000
I'm so fine.

1359
01:05:10.000 --> 01:05:12.000
Let's continue the test.

1360
01:05:12.000 --> 01:05:14.000
as you wish.

1361
01:05:14.000 --> 01:05:15.000
The final test

1362
01:05:15.000 --> 01:05:17.000
is the demon Queen of Skull Mountain,

1363
01:05:17.000 --> 01:05:20.000
Shi Ji.

1364
01:05:21.000 --> 01:05:22.000
Someone is requesting an urgent meeting
with Master Taiyi.

1365
01:05:22.000 --> 01:05:23.000
Huh?

1366
01:05:23.000 --> 01:05:25.000
Please help us!

1367
01:05:25.000 --> 01:05:26.000
It's Chentang Pass.

1368
01:05:26.000 --> 01:05:29.000
Something happened!

1369
01:05:51.000 --> 01:05:53.000
Dad.

1370
01:05:53.000 --> 01:05:55.000
Mom.

1371
01:05:57.000 --> 01:05:59.000
Dad.

1372
01:06:00.000 --> 01:06:02.000
Mom.

1373
01:06:03.000 --> 01:06:05.000
Dad?

1374
01:06:05.000 --> 01:06:07.000
Mom?

1375
01:06:15.000 --> 01:06:18.000
Dad!

1376
01:06:18.000 --> 01:06:21.000
Mom!

1377
01:06:41.000 --> 01:06:42.000
Calm down.

1378
01:06:42.000 --> 01:06:43.000
Let's keep looking.

1379
01:06:43.000 --> 01:06:45.000
Keep looking.

1380
01:06:46.000 --> 01:06:49.000
I received an urgent report as soon as
I ended seclusion.

1381
01:06:49.000 --> 01:06:52.000
Who could have committed
such a horrendous crime?

1382
01:06:52.000 --> 01:06:53.000
Master,

1383
01:06:53.000 --> 01:06:54.000
according to Shieldos,

1384
01:06:54.000 --> 01:06:56.000
they were struck by a tremendous force

1385
01:06:56.000 --> 01:06:57.000
and lost consciousness.

1386
01:06:57.000 --> 01:06:58.000
When they woke up,

1387
01:06:58.000 --> 01:07:01.000
people of Chentang Pass had
already been slaughtered.

1388
01:07:01.000 --> 01:07:02.000
We haven't obtained the elixir yet.

1389
01:07:02.000 --> 01:07:04.000
Why would they do that?

1390
01:07:04.000 --> 01:07:05.000
Brother,

1391
01:07:05.000 --> 01:07:07.000
any clue?

1392
01:07:07.000 --> 01:07:08.000
No, no.

1393
01:07:08.000 --> 01:07:11.000
where did all this lava come from?

1394
01:07:11.000 --> 01:07:12.000
Exactly.

1395
01:07:12.000 --> 01:07:14.000
There are no volcanoes
for hundreds of miles around.

1396
01:07:14.000 --> 01:07:17.000
This is truly bizarre.

1397
01:07:17.000 --> 01:07:19.000
Everyone, come quick!

1398
01:07:20.000 --> 01:07:23.000
What demon is this?

1399
01:07:23.000 --> 01:07:25.000
This is...

1400
01:07:25.000 --> 01:07:27.000
left by a Loong's claw.

1401
01:07:27.000 --> 01:07:29.000
Impossible!

1402
01:07:29.000 --> 01:07:32.000
The Loongs are all in Eastern Sea,

1403
01:07:32.000 --> 01:07:34.000
guarding the Suppression Seal.

1404
01:07:34.000 --> 01:07:36.000
Not a single one could have left.

1405
01:07:36.000 --> 01:07:37.000
Master,

1406
01:07:37.000 --> 01:07:38.000
if I remember correctly,

1407
01:07:38.000 --> 01:07:40.000
Queen Ao Run of Western Sea

1408
01:07:40.000 --> 01:07:42.000
has a special skill

1409
01:07:42.000 --> 01:07:44.000
called the Sky...

1410
01:07:44.000 --> 01:07:45.000
Sky-Splitting Claw.

1411
01:07:45.000 --> 01:07:47.000
Are you saying she used
the Sky-Splitting Claw

1412
01:07:47.000 --> 01:07:49.000
to cross into Chentang Pass?

1413
01:07:49.000 --> 01:07:50.000
That explains the lava.

1414
01:07:50.000 --> 01:07:53.000
It must have been transported
from the purgatory remotely.

1415
01:07:53.000 --> 01:07:55.000
But she's watched by
the Loong King of Eastern Sea.

1416
01:07:55.000 --> 01:07:57.000
It's impossible for her to cross over.

1417
01:07:57.000 --> 01:07:59.000
Then there's only one possibility left.

1418
01:07:59.000 --> 01:08:02.000
The thing I worried the most

1419
01:08:02.000 --> 01:08:04.000
happened.

1420
01:08:04.000 --> 01:08:06.000
The King of Eastern Sea has betrayed us?

1421
01:08:06.000 --> 01:08:08.000
This is too serious an accusation.

1422
01:08:08.000 --> 01:08:11.000
Could we be wrong?

1423
01:08:11.000 --> 01:08:13.000
No.

1424
01:08:13.000 --> 01:08:15.000
It's them!

1425
01:08:17.000 --> 01:08:19.000
What are you doing?

1426
01:08:26.000 --> 01:08:27.000
Don't be impulsive.

1427
01:08:27.000 --> 01:08:29.000
Are you heading to the Loong Palace?

1428
01:08:29.000 --> 01:08:31.000
That's the direction of Skull Mountain.

1429
01:08:31.000 --> 01:08:34.000
The Loongs slaughtered innocent civilians,

1430
01:08:34.000 --> 01:08:37.000
committing this unforgivable atrocity.

1431
01:08:37.000 --> 01:08:40.000
No need to consult with
fellow Golden Immortals.

1432
01:08:40.000 --> 01:08:42.000
I'll strike first and explain later.

1433
01:08:42.000 --> 01:08:43.000
Crana,

1434
01:08:43.000 --> 01:08:44.000
back to the palace with me.

1435
01:08:44.000 --> 01:08:47.000
Summon all the Demon Hunters.

1436
01:08:47.000 --> 01:08:49.000
Brother,

1437
01:08:49.000 --> 01:08:51.000
Nezha's parents were killed by demons.

1438
01:08:51.000 --> 01:08:54.000
We can't let anything happen to the child.

1439
01:08:54.000 --> 01:08:56.000
Go with Deero for him now.

1440
01:08:56.000 --> 01:08:59.000
Yes.

1441
01:09:01.000 --> 01:09:03.000
I know you're heartbroken right now,

1442
01:09:03.000 --> 01:09:04.000
but can you please

1443
01:09:04.000 --> 01:09:06.000
calm down for a moment?

1444
01:09:08.000 --> 01:09:09.000
Can you

1445
01:09:09.000 --> 01:09:11.000
take me to the Loong Palace first?

1446
01:09:11.000 --> 01:09:12.000
I'll confront my father and master

1447
01:09:12.000 --> 01:09:13.000
to get to the bottom of this.

1448
01:09:13.000 --> 01:09:17.000
Will that bring my parents back?

1449
01:09:28.000 --> 01:09:30.000
Mirror mirror on the wall,

1450
01:09:30.000 --> 01:09:33.000
who's the fairest within
ten miles and more?

1451
01:09:33.000 --> 01:09:34.000
It's you,

1452
01:09:34.000 --> 01:09:36.000
my lady.

1453
01:09:36.000 --> 01:09:39.000
And who is the fairest
within a hundred miles?

1454
01:09:39.000 --> 01:09:40.000
It's you, my lady.

1455
01:09:40.000 --> 01:09:41.000
What about a thousand miles?

1456
01:09:41.000 --> 01:09:42.000
It's you.

1457
01:09:42.000 --> 01:09:43.000
And ten thousand miles?

1458
01:09:43.000 --> 01:09:44.000
And in the whole world?

1459
01:09:44.000 --> 01:09:46.000
Still you.

1460
01:09:46.000 --> 01:09:47.000
Do you think I'm stupid?

1461
01:09:47.000 --> 01:09:48.000
Lie better, at least.

1462
01:09:48.000 --> 01:09:49.000
No, no.

1463
01:09:49.000 --> 01:09:51.000
I was just trying not to piss you off.

1464
01:09:51.000 --> 01:09:53.000
You know what?

1465
01:09:53.000 --> 01:09:55.000
Telling the truth won't make me mad.

1466
01:09:55.000 --> 01:09:56.000
Seriously?

1467
01:09:56.000 --> 01:09:59.000
I, Lady Shi Ji, am
indeed a stunning beauty,

1468
01:09:59.000 --> 01:10:02.000
but I know there's always someone better.

1469
01:10:02.000 --> 01:10:03.000
Go on and ask then.

1470
01:10:03.000 --> 01:10:04.000
Am I the fairest of them all?

1471
01:10:04.000 --> 01:10:06.000
No.

1472
01:10:06.000 --> 01:10:07.000
Fair enough.

1473
01:10:07.000 --> 01:10:10.000
Am I the fairest within ten thousand miles?

1474
01:10:10.000 --> 01:10:11.000
What about a thousand miles?

1475
01:10:11.000 --> 01:10:13.000
No.

1476
01:10:13.000 --> 01:10:14.000
Ten miles?

1477
01:10:14.000 --> 01:10:15.000
Nope.

1478
01:10:15.000 --> 01:10:18.000
Am I even the fairest on this mountain?

1479
01:10:18.000 --> 01:10:20.000
Nope.

1480
01:10:20.000 --> 01:10:23.000
There isn't any other
female in this mountain.

1481
01:10:23.000 --> 01:10:25.000
I'm female, too.

1482
01:10:25.000 --> 01:10:28.000
You promised you won't get mad.

1483
01:10:29.000 --> 01:10:30.000
You are prettier than me?

1484
01:10:30.000 --> 01:10:31.000
Help!

1485
01:10:31.000 --> 01:10:33.000
How the hell!

1486
01:10:35.000 --> 01:10:38.000
Demon, show yourself!

1487
01:10:38.000 --> 01:10:39.000
Who are you calling demon?

1488
01:10:39.000 --> 01:10:41.000
It's Lady Shi Ji.

1489
01:10:52.000 --> 01:10:53.000
Damn kid.

1490
01:10:53.000 --> 01:10:54.000
Have we even met?

1491
01:10:54.000 --> 01:10:57.000
What the hell are you up to?

1492
01:10:58.000 --> 01:10:59.000
You will be exposed.

1493
01:10:59.000 --> 01:11:00.000
Let me.

1494
01:11:00.000 --> 01:11:02.000
Stay out of it.

1495
01:11:23.000 --> 01:11:28.000
You think you can defeat me?

1496
01:11:47.000 --> 01:11:52.000
The entire mountain is my body.

1497
01:11:52.000 --> 01:11:55.000
I'll see how you can destroy me.

1498
01:12:03.000 --> 01:12:04.000
If you use more force,

1499
01:12:04.000 --> 01:12:06.000
your body will collapse!

1500
01:12:06.000 --> 01:12:07.000
I said,

1501
01:12:07.000 --> 01:12:12.000
stay out of it!

1502
01:12:20.000 --> 01:12:22.000
Already started!

1503
01:12:22.000 --> 01:12:24.000
Crap!

1504
01:12:31.000 --> 01:12:33.000
I'm so screwed.

1505
01:12:34.000 --> 01:12:35.000
Luckily there's some left.

1506
01:12:35.000 --> 01:12:38.000
I shall live to fight another day.

1507
01:12:38.000 --> 01:12:39.000
Damn kid.

1508
01:12:39.000 --> 01:12:41.000
Just you wait.

1509
01:12:42.000 --> 01:12:44.000
Nine-Loong Fire Trap!

1510
01:12:52.000 --> 01:12:55.000
No escape!

1511
01:12:55.000 --> 01:12:56.000
Oh my!

1512
01:12:56.000 --> 01:12:59.000
Reckless child.

1513
01:12:59.000 --> 01:13:00.000
Your body has almost gone.

1514
01:13:00.000 --> 01:13:02.000
Are you trying to kill yourself?

1515
01:13:02.000 --> 01:13:03.000
What's that fire earlier?

1516
01:13:03.000 --> 01:13:05.000
Isn't Nezha

1517
01:13:05.000 --> 01:13:06.000
a frost mage?

1518
01:13:06.000 --> 01:13:08.000
Who... who said that?

1519
01:13:08.000 --> 01:13:09.000
Frost, flame, I taught him everything.

1520
01:13:09.000 --> 01:13:10.000
His powers are

1521
01:13:10.000 --> 01:13:11.000
a combination of ice and fire.

1522
01:13:11.000 --> 01:13:13.000
Is that possible?

1523
01:13:13.000 --> 01:13:14.000
The Spirit Pearl is endowed
with unparalleled talents.

1524
01:13:14.000 --> 01:13:16.000
Can't judge him by normal standards.

1525
01:13:16.000 --> 01:13:17.000
Which one of us is the teacher?

1526
01:13:17.000 --> 01:13:18.000
You think you know better than me?

1527
01:13:18.000 --> 01:13:19.000
I wouldn't dare.

1528
01:13:19.000 --> 01:13:20.000
However,

1529
01:13:20.000 --> 01:13:22.000
I did sense a strong presence

1530
01:13:22.000 --> 01:13:24.000
of demonic energy earlier

1531
01:13:24.000 --> 01:13:26.000
About that...

1532
01:13:26.000 --> 01:13:27.000
Shi Ji must have released it.

1533
01:13:27.000 --> 01:13:29.000
What are you saying, fatty?

1534
01:13:29.000 --> 01:13:30.000
I did not...

1535
01:13:30.000 --> 01:13:31.000
Was it you? Just tell me, was it?

1536
01:13:31.000 --> 01:13:32.000
Say it!

1537
01:13:32.000 --> 01:13:33.000
Yes, it was me.

1538
01:13:33.000 --> 01:13:34.000
Stop shaking.

1539
01:13:34.000 --> 01:13:36.000
I'm about to throw up!

1540
01:13:37.000 --> 01:13:38.000
See? I told you.

1541
01:13:41.000 --> 01:13:42.000
Nezha,

1542
01:13:42.000 --> 01:13:44.000
you've passed three levels.

1543
01:13:44.000 --> 01:13:45.000
Today,

1544
01:13:45.000 --> 01:13:47.000
I will personally cast

1545
01:13:47.000 --> 01:13:50.000
the Ascension Spell for you.

1546
01:13:57.000 --> 01:13:59.000
I've been through all of this back there.

1547
01:13:59.000 --> 01:14:01.000
I was probably too nervous.

1548
01:14:01.000 --> 01:14:03.000
The Ascension Spell is
longer than I remember.

1549
01:14:12.000 --> 01:14:14.000
From now on,

1550
01:14:14.000 --> 01:14:18.000
you're an Immortal of the Chan Sect.

1551
01:14:38.000 --> 01:14:41.000
This Yu Xu Treasure Vault

1552
01:14:41.000 --> 01:14:43.000
houses all sorts of rare magic items.

1553
01:14:43.000 --> 01:14:45.000
Elixir Reparo.

1554
01:14:45.000 --> 01:14:47.000
You can only pick one.

1555
01:14:47.000 --> 01:14:48.000
Don't you need more time?

1556
01:14:48.000 --> 01:14:51.000
Elixir Reparo.

1557
01:15:49.000 --> 01:15:51.000
Yu Xu Palace has sent messengers

1558
01:15:51.000 --> 01:15:55.000
to inform the Twelve
about what the Loongs did.

1559
01:15:55.000 --> 01:15:56.000
However, due to the great distance,

1560
01:15:56.000 --> 01:16:00.000
my brothers and sisters
can't make it here sooner.

1561
01:16:00.000 --> 01:16:01.000
This time,

1562
01:16:01.000 --> 01:16:03.000
I myself will lead the hunt

1563
01:16:03.000 --> 01:16:05.000
on the Loongs.

1564
01:16:05.000 --> 01:16:06.000
Nezha,

1565
01:16:06.000 --> 01:16:09.000
will you fight alongside me?

1566
01:16:09.000 --> 01:16:12.000
Let me go back to Chentang Pass first.

1567
01:16:12.000 --> 01:16:14.000
Then we'll seek revenge on the Loong King.

1568
01:16:14.000 --> 01:16:15.000
OK.

1569
01:16:15.000 --> 01:16:17.000
With your extraordinary combat skills,

1570
01:16:17.000 --> 01:16:22.000
you'd be a great help
in destroying the Loong Palace.

1571
01:16:39.000 --> 01:16:41.000
I've paid back

1572
01:16:41.000 --> 01:16:44.000
everything I owed you.

1573
01:16:44.000 --> 01:16:45.000
Wait.

1574
01:16:45.000 --> 01:16:46.000
When I get my body back,

1575
01:16:46.000 --> 01:16:47.000
I will go with you to
the Loong Palace, okay?

1576
01:16:47.000 --> 01:16:50.000
You know well what I'm going to do.

1577
01:16:50.000 --> 01:16:53.000
You being there will only make it harder.

1578
01:16:54.000 --> 01:16:57.000
Next time we meet,

1579
01:16:57.000 --> 01:17:00.000
we're foes instead of friends.

1580
01:17:01.000 --> 01:17:02.000
Ugh...

1581
01:17:02.000 --> 01:17:04.000
Karma it is.

1582
01:17:07.000 --> 01:17:09.000
No, you can't leave!

1583
01:17:09.000 --> 01:17:12.000
Your soul will scatter before
you get to the Loong Palace.

1584
01:17:15.000 --> 01:17:18.000
Nine-Loong Fire Trap!

1585
01:17:24.000 --> 01:17:26.000
Calm down, will you?

1586
01:17:26.000 --> 01:17:29.000
won't change anything.

1587
01:17:29.000 --> 01:17:30.000
Leave me alone.

1588
01:17:30.000 --> 01:17:31.000
Let me out!

1589
01:17:31.000 --> 01:17:32.000
No!

1590
01:17:32.000 --> 01:17:33.000
I promised Nezha

1591
01:17:33.000 --> 01:17:35.000
I'd save you no matter what.

1592
01:17:44.000 --> 01:17:47.000
Pah! Pah!

1593
01:17:47.000 --> 01:17:50.000
Suffocating!

1594
01:18:39.000 --> 01:18:41.000
Who's there?

1595
01:18:41.000 --> 01:18:44.000
I'm Immortal Wuliang of the Chan Sect.

1596
01:18:44.000 --> 01:18:45.000
Ao Guang,

1597
01:18:45.000 --> 01:18:47.000
do you admit your guilt?

1598
01:18:48.000 --> 01:18:49.000
So,

1599
01:18:49.000 --> 01:18:51.000
you've found out?

1600
01:18:51.000 --> 01:18:52.000
Is

1601
01:18:52.000 --> 01:18:54.000
Ao Bing still alive?

1602
01:18:54.000 --> 01:18:55.000
I'll accept whatever
punishment you give me,

1603
01:18:55.000 --> 01:18:57.000
but please spare my son.

1604
01:18:57.000 --> 01:18:58.000
Nonsense!

1605
01:18:58.000 --> 01:19:02.000
The Court of Heaven ordered your clan
to suppress the sea monsters.

1606
01:19:02.000 --> 01:19:04.000
Instead, you colluded with them

1607
01:19:04.000 --> 01:19:06.000
and slaughtered Chentang Pass.

1608
01:19:06.000 --> 01:19:07.000
What?

1609
01:19:07.000 --> 01:19:10.000
The Loongs have committed
an unforgivable crime.

1610
01:19:10.000 --> 01:19:14.000
justice shall be done.

1611
01:19:30.000 --> 01:19:31.000
Encompassed are the earth and the skies.

1612
01:19:31.000 --> 01:19:33.000
Unleash the power with boundless might.

1613
01:19:33.000 --> 01:19:35.000
Let the Tianyuan rise and stand tall.

1614
01:19:35.000 --> 01:19:37.000
Reign supreme above them all.

1615
01:19:37.000 --> 01:19:39.000
Open Cauldron!

1616
01:20:07.000 --> 01:20:10.000
Show yourselves!

1617
01:20:12.000 --> 01:20:15.000
What have you done to Chentang Pass?

1618
01:20:15.000 --> 01:20:16.000
Didn't big brother tell us

1619
01:20:16.000 --> 01:20:19.000
to follow Master Shen's orders?

1620
01:20:19.000 --> 01:20:22.000
Shen Gongbao?!

1621
01:20:30.000 --> 01:20:32.000
Speaking of the emergency,

1622
01:20:32.000 --> 01:20:36.000
you should focus on present.

1623
01:20:37.000 --> 01:20:38.000
My King,

1624
01:20:38.000 --> 01:20:39.000
we can't sit here and wait to die!

1625
01:20:39.000 --> 01:20:40.000
If I go into battle,

1626
01:20:40.000 --> 01:20:41.000
the Suppression Seal will...

1627
01:20:41.000 --> 01:20:42.000
Leave that to us.

1628
01:20:42.000 --> 01:20:43.000
Joining all our powers,

1629
01:20:43.000 --> 01:20:46.000
we can hold it for long enough.

1630
01:20:46.000 --> 01:20:48.000
Fine.

1631
01:21:01.000 --> 01:21:04.000
I've had enough!

1632
01:21:13.000 --> 01:21:15.000
You wretched demon!

1633
01:21:24.000 --> 01:21:28.000
This is an once-in-a-millennium chance
for revenge.

1634
01:21:28.000 --> 01:21:30.000
Break out of the purgatory!

1635
01:21:30.000 --> 01:21:33.000
Destroy the Loong Palace!

1636
01:23:01.000 --> 01:23:04.000
Soul Blade!

1637
01:23:22.000 --> 01:23:23.000
Old fool!

1638
01:23:23.000 --> 01:23:25.000
Taste my sword!

1639
01:23:39.000 --> 01:23:40.000
Releasing demonic energy like this...

1640
01:23:40.000 --> 01:23:42.000
aren't you afraid of
exposing your identity?

1641
01:23:42.000 --> 01:23:44.000
I told you,

1642
01:23:44.000 --> 01:23:47.000
if you dared to harm Chentang Pass,

1643
01:23:47.000 --> 01:23:51.000
I would smash your palace into PIECES!

1644
01:23:55.000 --> 01:23:58.000
Is Ao Bing dead?

1645
01:24:59.000 --> 01:25:02.000
Move! Out of my way!

1646
01:25:36.000 --> 01:25:38.000
Rise!

1647
01:26:45.000 --> 01:26:46.000
Do you have a death wish?

1648
01:26:46.000 --> 01:26:50.000
Let's see how long your body can take it.

1649
01:26:50.000 --> 01:26:51.000
I don't care if I live or die.

1650
01:26:51.000 --> 01:26:55.000
As long as you're dead!

1651
01:27:11.000 --> 01:27:14.000
Now is the time!

1652
01:27:30.000 --> 01:27:32.000
Look what you've done!

1653
01:27:32.000 --> 01:27:37.000
Is annihilation for all
really what you want?

1654
01:27:38.000 --> 01:27:40.000
The chains.

1655
01:27:46.000 --> 01:27:49.000
Even the Eastern Sea Loong King
can't match your power.

1656
01:27:49.000 --> 01:27:51.000
I was right after all.

1657
01:27:51.000 --> 01:27:55.000
You're exactly what the Chan Sect needs.

1658
01:27:55.000 --> 01:27:58.000
Your parents spent
their lives fighting evil.

1659
01:27:58.000 --> 01:27:59.000
From now on,

1660
01:27:59.000 --> 01:28:02.000
you must carry on their legacy

1661
01:28:02.000 --> 01:28:06.000
and eliminate all the demons.

1662
01:28:06.000 --> 01:28:09.000
Let me avenge your loss

1663
01:28:09.000 --> 01:28:11.000
by turning these bastards into pills.

1664
01:28:11.000 --> 01:28:12.000
Escort me!

1665
01:28:12.000 --> 01:28:14.000
Yes, master!

1666
01:28:59.000 --> 01:29:06.000
Nezha!

1667
01:29:06.000 --> 01:29:07.000
Dad!

1668
01:29:07.000 --> 01:29:08.000
Nezha!

1669
01:29:08.000 --> 01:29:09.000
Mom!

1670
01:29:09.000 --> 01:29:13.000
Nezha!

1671
01:29:17.000 --> 01:29:18.000
Son, are you alright?

1672
01:29:18.000 --> 01:29:20.000
Your body...

1673
01:29:20.000 --> 01:29:23.000
I... I...

1674
01:29:23.000 --> 01:29:24.000
They already know

1675
01:29:24.000 --> 01:29:27.000
about you and Ao Bing.

1676
01:29:27.000 --> 01:29:29.000
I... I...

1677
01:29:29.000 --> 01:29:31.000
I thought...

1678
01:29:31.000 --> 01:29:37.000
I'd never see you again.

1679
01:29:44.000 --> 01:29:45.000
Master is still casting the spell.

1680
01:29:45.000 --> 01:29:48.000
We need to buy as much time as we can.

1681
01:29:48.000 --> 01:29:49.000
Nezha,

1682
01:29:49.000 --> 01:29:52.000
it wasn't my father who
slaughtered Chentang Pass.

1683
01:29:52.000 --> 01:29:53.000
The real culprit

1684
01:29:53.000 --> 01:29:56.000
is him, the Immortal Wuliang!

1685
01:30:14.000 --> 01:30:16.000
Shieldos!

1686
01:31:01.000 --> 01:31:02.000
Loongs.

1687
01:31:02.000 --> 01:31:04.000
Brother,

1688
01:31:04.000 --> 01:31:07.000
it's been a while.

1689
01:31:07.000 --> 01:31:09.000
Why are you here?

1690
01:31:09.000 --> 01:31:10.000
Shen Gongbao,

1691
01:31:10.000 --> 01:31:12.000
you collude with the Loongs.

1692
01:31:12.000 --> 01:31:13.000
What are you up to?

1693
01:31:13.000 --> 01:31:15.000
I should be ask... asking you.

1694
01:31:15.000 --> 01:31:16.000
You captured my father.

1695
01:31:16.000 --> 01:31:19.000
What are you up to?

1696
01:31:19.000 --> 01:31:21.000
Who said I captured your father?

1697
01:31:21.000 --> 01:31:23.000
Only you know my family's situation.

1698
01:31:23.000 --> 01:31:25.000
If you didn't give the order,

1699
01:31:25.000 --> 01:31:28.000
why would Nezha and the Demon Hunters
hunt my father down?

1700
01:31:28.000 --> 01:31:31.000
And my little brother's arrow wound...

1701
01:31:31.000 --> 01:31:33.000
It's obviously

1702
01:31:33.000 --> 01:31:37.000
caused by your disciple, Deero!

1703
01:31:40.000 --> 01:31:44.000
There's the talent I recruited myself.

1704
01:31:44.000 --> 01:31:48.000
Nothing slips past you.

1705
01:31:48.000 --> 01:31:51.000
After all, I've done your dirty work
for so many years.

1706
01:31:51.000 --> 01:31:53.000
I can also guess your purpose here

1707
01:31:53.000 --> 01:31:55.000
putting up a show in Chentang Pass.

1708
01:31:55.000 --> 01:31:59.000
You are trying to fram... frame the Loongs,
aren't you?

1709
01:31:59.000 --> 01:32:03.000
Is this how you repay me,
your brother and mentor?

1710
01:32:03.000 --> 01:32:06.000
You've always use...
used me for your benefit.

1711
01:32:06.000 --> 01:32:07.000
Between you and me,

1712
01:32:07.000 --> 01:32:10.000
there's only grudge, not gratitude.

1713
01:32:10.000 --> 01:32:13.000
May I interest you in a deal?

1714
01:32:13.000 --> 01:32:15.000
Master Immortal.

1715
01:32:15.000 --> 01:32:18.000
As the overseer of Yu Xu Palace,

1716
01:32:18.000 --> 01:32:22.000
you must know the spell to
unhinge the Sea-Stabilizing Chains.

1717
01:32:22.000 --> 01:32:24.000
I do.

1718
01:32:24.000 --> 01:32:25.000
So what?

1719
01:32:25.000 --> 01:32:27.000
You... you are going to rebel?

1720
01:32:27.000 --> 01:32:29.000
A thousand years ago, the four of us
fought the celestial realm together.

1721
01:32:29.000 --> 01:32:31.000
Who's then betrayed us and

1722
01:32:31.000 --> 01:32:32.000
cast us into the purgatory?

1723
01:32:32.000 --> 01:32:35.000
Now Wuliang is targeting Ao Guang,

1724
01:32:35.000 --> 01:32:37.000
that's exactly what we want.

1725
01:32:37.000 --> 01:32:40.000
I've long heard that Immortal Wuliang
recruit talents without bias.

1726
01:32:40.000 --> 01:32:44.000
I trust it you know well what we can do.

1727
01:32:44.000 --> 01:32:46.000
If you can free us from the purgatory

1728
01:32:46.000 --> 01:32:48.000
and help us achieve immortality,

1729
01:32:48.000 --> 01:32:51.000
we are willing to offer our humble service.

1730
01:32:51.000 --> 01:32:54.000
Plus the secret of the Spirit Pearl
and the Demon Orb.

1731
01:32:54.000 --> 01:32:56.000
The Spirit Pearl and the Demon Orb?

1732
01:32:56.000 --> 01:33:00.000
Whe... where's your
spirit of fighting back?

1733
01:33:00.000 --> 01:33:03.000
We were young and ignorant!

1734
01:33:04.000 --> 01:33:07.000
A thousand years of imprisonment

1735
01:33:07.000 --> 01:33:09.000
has taught us about the rules

1736
01:33:09.000 --> 01:33:12.000
and the rulers.

1737
01:33:13.000 --> 01:33:14.000
Smart.

1738
01:33:14.000 --> 01:33:16.000
But you're so unpredictable.

1739
01:33:16.000 --> 01:33:18.000
How can I trust you?

1740
01:33:18.000 --> 01:33:20.000
Unless you let me place on you...

1741
01:33:20.000 --> 01:33:23.000
We are willing.

1742
01:33:31.000 --> 01:33:33.000
The three Loongs willingly agreed

1743
01:33:33.000 --> 01:33:35.000
to let Wuliang place a curse on them.

1744
01:33:35.000 --> 01:33:37.000
If they dare to disobey in the future,

1745
01:33:37.000 --> 01:33:41.000
Wuliang can take their lives at any time.

1746
01:33:41.000 --> 01:33:43.000
Wuliang then fulfilled his promise,

1747
01:33:43.000 --> 01:33:47.000
freeing them from the
Sea-Stabilizing Chains.

1748
01:33:47.000 --> 01:33:49.000
Whenever a powerful force is discovered,

1749
01:33:49.000 --> 01:33:50.000
he orchestrates massacres,

1750
01:33:50.000 --> 01:33:51.000
frames others,

1751
01:33:51.000 --> 01:33:53.000
and sends troops to capture them.

1752
01:33:53.000 --> 01:33:54.000
According to Shen Gongbao,

1753
01:33:54.000 --> 01:33:57.000
he had carried out many
such tasks for Wuliang

1754
01:33:57.000 --> 01:34:01.000
in exchange for a chance
to join the Chan Sect.

1755
01:34:01.000 --> 01:34:04.000
This time, Wuliang came
to destroy Chentang Pass

1756
01:34:04.000 --> 01:34:06.000
and frame the Loongs of Eastern Sea.

1757
01:34:06.000 --> 01:34:07.000
One thing led to another,

1758
01:34:07.000 --> 01:34:09.000
he ended up recruiting
the three Loong kings.

1759
01:34:09.000 --> 01:34:11.000
And from them,

1760
01:34:11.000 --> 01:34:14.000
he learned the secret of the Demon Orb
and the Spirit Pearl.

1761
01:34:15.000 --> 01:34:19.000
they deliberately left
two clueless survivors

1762
01:34:19.000 --> 01:34:23.000
to tell Yu Xu Palace what happened.

1763
01:34:43.000 --> 01:34:45.000
Seeing no hope of breaking through,

1764
01:34:45.000 --> 01:34:46.000
Shen Gongbao came up with a plan.

1765
01:34:46.000 --> 01:34:49.000
He had the Yaksha petrify us,

1766
01:34:49.000 --> 01:34:51.000
then hide us in the sewers.

1767
01:34:51.000 --> 01:34:55.000
Later, he waited for the
right time to revive us.

1768
01:34:55.000 --> 01:34:56.000
And you?

1769
01:34:56.000 --> 01:34:58.000
My families are gone.

1770
01:34:58.000 --> 01:35:01.000
I have nothing left to hold onto.

1771
01:35:03.000 --> 01:35:06.000
Over there!

1772
01:35:20.000 --> 01:35:22.000
The demons captured by the Demon Hunters

1773
01:35:22.000 --> 01:35:24.000
are not, as outsiders think,

1774
01:35:24.000 --> 01:35:27.000
being reformed in Yu Xu Palace.

1775
01:35:27.000 --> 01:35:31.000
Instead, they are thrown into the
Tianyuan Cauldron by Wuliang,

1776
01:35:31.000 --> 01:35:32.000
refined into pills of immortality

1777
01:35:32.000 --> 01:35:34.000
to strengthen the Chan Sect's power.

1778
01:35:34.000 --> 01:35:35.000
Brother,

1779
01:35:35.000 --> 01:35:38.000
how could you commit such atrocities?

1780
01:35:38.000 --> 01:35:39.000
How...

1781
01:35:39.000 --> 01:35:40.000
How are you going to face our master

1782
01:35:40.000 --> 01:35:42.000
and the teachings we received?

1783
01:35:42.000 --> 01:35:45.000
Now that you know what Wuliang did,

1784
01:35:45.000 --> 01:35:47.000
you should stop before it's too late.

1785
01:35:47.000 --> 01:35:48.000
Take him back to the palace

1786
01:35:48.000 --> 01:35:51.000
to face punishment from the Supreme Lord.

1787
01:35:57.000 --> 01:36:00.000
The Demon Hunters were personally trained
by Master Wuliang.

1788
01:36:00.000 --> 01:36:04.000
Do you think a few words would turn us
against him?

1789
01:36:04.000 --> 01:36:05.000
So,

1790
01:36:05.000 --> 01:36:08.000
I was wrong about the Loongs.

1791
01:36:11.000 --> 01:36:14.000
Let them go!

1792
01:36:30.000 --> 01:36:32.000
Let me help.

1793
01:36:55.000 --> 01:36:56.000
You betrayed us?

1794
01:36:56.000 --> 01:36:58.000
We learned that from you, Big Brother.

1795
01:36:58.000 --> 01:37:00.000
Back then, in order to protect our kind,

1796
01:37:00.000 --> 01:37:01.000
I had no choice!

1797
01:37:01.000 --> 01:37:05.000
Well, in order to protect myself now,

1798
01:37:05.000 --> 01:37:07.000
Neither do I.

1799
01:37:07.000 --> 01:37:09.000
My King, wait for us!

1800
01:37:09.000 --> 01:37:10.000
Don't leave us behind!

1801
01:37:10.000 --> 01:37:11.000
My King, take us with you!

1802
01:37:11.000 --> 01:37:14.000
My King! My King!

1803
01:37:18.000 --> 01:37:20.000
You've all been sold out!

1804
01:37:28.000 --> 01:37:31.000
Loong King of Southern Sea.

1805
01:37:34.000 --> 01:37:36.000
Loong King of Northern Sea.

1806
01:37:39.000 --> 01:37:41.000
Loong Queen of Western Sea.

1807
01:37:51.000 --> 01:37:52.000
Nephew,

1808
01:37:52.000 --> 01:37:55.000
it's playtime with your uncle.

1809
01:38:05.000 --> 01:38:07.000
Take my spear!

1810
01:38:12.000 --> 01:38:15.000
Take my axe!

1811
01:38:16.000 --> 01:38:18.000
Take my wheel!

1812
01:38:49.000 --> 01:38:50.000
Take my wheel times a hundred!

1813
01:38:50.000 --> 01:38:51.000
Two hundreds!

1814
01:38:51.000 --> 01:38:53.000
Three hundreds!

1815
01:38:58.000 --> 01:38:59.000
Enough, huh?

1816
01:38:59.000 --> 01:39:00.000
Bullshit!

1817
01:39:00.000 --> 01:39:02.000
There weren't that many.

1818
01:39:02.000 --> 01:39:03.000
Your body is still unstable.

1819
01:39:03.000 --> 01:39:04.000
Don't exhaust yourself.

1820
01:39:04.000 --> 01:39:05.000
For my mistakes,

1821
01:39:05.000 --> 01:39:09.000
I would give my life
for freeing the Loongs.

1822
01:39:09.000 --> 01:39:12.000
Young and vicious.

1823
01:39:13.000 --> 01:39:16.000
Let me have some fun with you, little one.

1824
01:39:45.000 --> 01:39:46.000
Bullying a child,

1825
01:39:46.000 --> 01:39:48.000
shameless and vile!

1826
01:39:56.000 --> 01:39:57.000
Hey!

1827
01:39:57.000 --> 01:39:58.000
How dare you hit your master's brother!

1828
01:39:58.000 --> 01:40:00.000
Bullying an uncle,

1829
01:40:00.000 --> 01:40:02.000
eat a knuckle!

1830
01:40:38.000 --> 01:40:39.000
This won't do.

1831
01:40:39.000 --> 01:40:40.000
This is a mess.

1832
01:40:40.000 --> 01:40:41.000
Then let's make it an even bigger one.

1833
01:40:41.000 --> 01:40:43.000
How about some vapor?

1834
01:40:43.000 --> 01:40:45.000
Sure.

1835
01:40:47.000 --> 01:40:49.000
Take them down!

1836
01:40:55.000 --> 01:40:58.000
Watch out for sneaking!

1837
01:41:04.000 --> 01:41:06.000
There you are.

1838
01:41:07.000 --> 01:41:09.000
Careful, it's me!

1839
01:41:09.000 --> 01:41:11.000
My apology.

1840
01:41:11.000 --> 01:41:13.000
Nezha!

1841
01:41:14.000 --> 01:41:16.000
Ah!

1842
01:41:18.000 --> 01:41:19.000
Surprise!

1843
01:41:19.000 --> 01:41:20.000
LOL!

1844
01:41:20.000 --> 01:41:22.000
Transformation Spell?

1845
01:41:27.000 --> 01:41:28.000
Are you insane?

1846
01:41:28.000 --> 01:41:30.000
You can't fool me.

1847
01:41:32.000 --> 01:41:33.000
Hmm.

1848
01:41:33.000 --> 01:41:34.000
What are you...

1849
01:41:34.000 --> 01:41:36.000
She sells seashells by the seashore.

1850
01:41:36.000 --> 01:41:37.000
What?

1851
01:41:37.000 --> 01:41:38.000
You don't know the code.

1852
01:41:38.000 --> 01:41:40.000
Imposter!

1853
01:41:41.000 --> 01:41:43.000
So you really are an imposter!

1854
01:41:47.000 --> 01:41:49.000
Unbelievable!

1855
01:41:54.000 --> 01:41:57.000
Serves you right.

1856
01:41:57.000 --> 01:41:58.000
Code.

1857
01:41:58.000 --> 01:42:04.000
Eh... he sells bells in the big well?

1858
01:42:04.000 --> 01:42:06.000
Wrong!

1859
01:42:06.000 --> 01:42:07.000
It's "she sells seashells by the seashore

1860
01:42:07.000 --> 01:42:09.000
and the shells she
sells all smell for sure".

1861
01:42:09.000 --> 01:42:11.000
I'm the real one!

1862
01:42:11.000 --> 01:42:13.000
How come I don't know this code?

1863
01:42:13.000 --> 01:42:15.000
We just made it up!

1864
01:42:16.000 --> 01:42:18.000
Can you make it easier?

1865
01:42:18.000 --> 01:42:21.000
Too hard!

1866
01:42:21.000 --> 01:42:23.000
You idiot!

1867
01:42:23.000 --> 01:42:24.000
Don't come near me!

1868
01:42:24.000 --> 01:42:25.000
Imposter!

1869
01:42:25.000 --> 01:42:26.000
I'm the real Ao Shun!

1870
01:42:26.000 --> 01:42:27.000
Crap! You don't know the code!

1871
01:42:27.000 --> 01:42:30.000
Neither do you!

1872
01:42:30.000 --> 01:42:31.000
That's true.

1873
01:42:31.000 --> 01:42:33.000
Does it mean I'm an imposter, too?

1874
01:42:33.000 --> 01:42:35.000
My goodness.

1875
01:42:35.000 --> 01:42:36.000
Tai Chi flows in harmony divine,

1876
01:42:36.000 --> 01:42:37.000
Five elements perfectly align.

1877
01:42:37.000 --> 01:42:39.000
True fire of Samadhi ignites the gold.

1878
01:42:39.000 --> 01:42:40.000
A perfect pill, its power unfolds.

1879
01:42:40.000 --> 01:42:43.000
Swift and Uplift!

1880
01:43:09.000 --> 01:43:10.000
Why are you so scared?

1881
01:43:10.000 --> 01:43:14.000
We used to bathe in lava like it's nothing.

1882
01:43:14.000 --> 01:43:17.000
Hot! Hot!

1883
01:43:18.000 --> 01:43:19.000
Oh no!

1884
01:43:19.000 --> 01:43:22.000
It's the true fire of Samadhi.

1885
01:43:23.000 --> 01:43:24.000
What are you looking at?

1886
01:43:24.000 --> 01:43:28.000
If anyone should eat this, it's me!

1887
01:43:30.000 --> 01:43:32.000
Yum.

1888
01:43:35.000 --> 01:43:38.000
Let go of my father!

1889
01:43:38.000 --> 01:43:40.000
Freeze!

1890
01:43:50.000 --> 01:43:51.000
What a Spirit Pearl!

1891
01:43:51.000 --> 01:43:56.000
Perfect match with the Demon Orb.

1892
01:43:56.000 --> 01:43:58.000
Ao Bing!

1893
01:43:59.000 --> 01:44:00.000
Hyah!

1894
01:44:00.000 --> 01:44:02.000
Freeze!

1895
01:44:12.000 --> 01:44:14.000
The Heart-Piercing Curse.

1896
01:44:14.000 --> 01:44:18.000
Since I already knew your true identities,

1897
01:44:18.000 --> 01:44:22.000
how could I not have a backup plan?

1898
01:44:23.000 --> 01:44:24.000
This is impossible!

1899
01:44:24.000 --> 01:44:25.000
That curse is quite complex.

1900
01:44:25.000 --> 01:44:28.000
When did you cast it?

1901
01:44:28.000 --> 01:44:29.000
Oh...

1902
01:44:29.000 --> 01:44:32.000
That's why the Ascension
Spell took so long.

1903
01:44:32.000 --> 01:44:34.000
You slipped in something.

1904
01:45:03.000 --> 01:45:06.000
You old fart!

1905
01:45:09.000 --> 01:45:10.000
Even the Demon Orb

1906
01:45:10.000 --> 01:45:15.000
won't be able to break the
Heart-Piercing Curse so quick.

1907
01:45:15.000 --> 01:45:20.000
A thousand spikes have pierced
through your nerves and veins.

1908
01:45:20.000 --> 01:45:21.000
Forcing any movement

1909
01:45:21.000 --> 01:45:23.000
will only result in your body

1910
01:45:23.000 --> 01:45:26.000
being torn apart.

1911
01:45:26.000 --> 01:45:30.000
No wonder I couldn't sense any living aura.

1912
01:45:30.000 --> 01:45:33.000
You were petrified.

1913
01:45:33.000 --> 01:45:34.000
But alive.

1914
01:45:34.000 --> 01:45:37.000
Only hurt Nezha.

1915
01:45:38.000 --> 01:45:41.000
The Spirit Pearl

1916
01:45:41.000 --> 01:45:43.000
and the Demon Orb

1917
01:45:43.000 --> 01:45:45.000
are precious treasures.

1918
01:45:45.000 --> 01:45:50.000
I could treat you well

1919
01:45:52.000 --> 01:45:55.000
but now only for pill.

1920
01:46:09.000 --> 01:46:11.000
Ao Bing!

1921
01:46:11.000 --> 01:46:12.000
You...

1922
01:46:12.000 --> 01:46:13.000
you're still alive!

1923
01:46:13.000 --> 01:46:15.000
Ungh!

1924
01:46:15.000 --> 01:46:16.000
It's the Heart-Piercing
Curse casted by Wuliang.

1925
01:46:16.000 --> 01:46:20.000
And he was the one that slaughtered
Chentang Pass framing it on the Loongs.

1926
01:46:22.000 --> 01:46:23.000
Father,

1927
01:46:23.000 --> 01:46:24.000
Nezha was deceived.

1928
01:46:24.000 --> 01:46:25.000
Don't blame him.

1929
01:46:25.000 --> 01:46:26.000
Whatever you want to do, do it to me.

1930
01:46:26.000 --> 01:46:28.000
Leave my parents out of this.

1931
01:46:33.000 --> 01:46:36.000
Killing you won't change anything.

1932
01:46:49.000 --> 01:46:52.000
We're all doomed to die here.

1933
01:46:52.000 --> 01:46:55.000
If anyone still holds grudges,

1934
01:46:55.000 --> 01:46:57.000
be my guest.

1935
01:47:05.000 --> 01:47:06.000
Brother,

1936
01:47:06.000 --> 01:47:08.000
the Chan Sect has a noble reputation,

1937
01:47:08.000 --> 01:47:12.000
how could you commit
such a horrible clanger?

1938
01:47:12.000 --> 01:47:13.000
Don't make more mistakes!

1939
01:47:13.000 --> 01:47:15.000
Why don't you go back
and confess to Master?

1940
01:47:15.000 --> 01:47:17.000
I'll plead for mercy on your behalf.

1941
01:47:17.000 --> 01:47:18.000
You...

1942
01:47:18.000 --> 01:47:21.000
indiscriminate fool!

1943
01:47:21.000 --> 01:47:24.000
Should the immortals'
place in the world is secured

1944
01:47:24.000 --> 01:47:26.000
or you ungrateful slackers are half as

1945
01:47:26.000 --> 01:47:29.000
diligent as the demons,

1946
01:47:29.000 --> 01:47:31.000
I wouldn't have wasted
this much time and efforts!

1947
01:47:31.000 --> 01:47:33.000
Even if it leads to my own doom

1948
01:47:33.000 --> 01:47:35.000
and infamy,

1949
01:47:35.000 --> 01:47:38.000
I did it for the eternal
dominance of Chan Sect.

1950
01:47:38.000 --> 01:47:40.000
Conscience...

1951
01:47:40.000 --> 01:47:43.000
conscience...

1952
01:47:46.000 --> 01:47:49.000
My conscience is clear.

1953
01:47:51.000 --> 01:47:52.000
Another one is done.

1954
01:47:52.000 --> 01:47:54.000
I can't possibly eat any more.

1955
01:47:54.000 --> 01:47:55.000
You should try some.

1956
01:47:55.000 --> 01:47:56.000
Thanks.

1957
01:47:56.000 --> 01:47:58.000
When my fins are done,
you should try some too.

1958
01:47:58.000 --> 01:48:00.000
The claws are ready as well.

1959
01:48:00.000 --> 01:48:02.000
We should swop and share.

1960
01:48:02.000 --> 01:48:04.000
What's going on?

1961
01:48:04.000 --> 01:48:07.000
My body...

1962
01:48:08.000 --> 01:48:09.000
He's become a pill!

1963
01:48:09.000 --> 01:48:11.000
I'm still so young.

1964
01:48:11.000 --> 01:48:12.000
I don't want to die.

1965
01:48:12.000 --> 01:48:14.000
No, let me out.

1966
01:48:14.000 --> 01:48:15.000
Help!

1967
01:48:15.000 --> 01:48:17.000
Stay calm!

1968
01:48:17.000 --> 01:48:19.000
Focus all your energy!

1969
01:48:19.000 --> 01:48:22.000
Hold on for as long as you can.

1970
01:48:28.000 --> 01:48:29.000
Son!

1971
01:48:29.000 --> 01:48:31.000
Your power is greater than mine.

1972
01:48:31.000 --> 01:48:32.000
You can get through.

1973
01:48:32.000 --> 01:48:34.000
If you can hold out
until the heart-piercing curse fades,

1974
01:48:34.000 --> 01:48:36.000
you'll have a chance to escape.

1975
01:48:36.000 --> 01:48:39.000
The heart-piercing curse
takes at least six hours.

1976
01:48:39.000 --> 01:48:40.000
I'm afraid...

1977
01:48:40.000 --> 01:48:43.000
I won't be able to last that long.

1978
01:48:47.000 --> 01:48:48.000
My lady.

1979
01:48:48.000 --> 01:48:49.000
Wake up, mom.

1980
01:48:49.000 --> 01:48:53.000
Nezha, Nezha?

1981
01:48:53.000 --> 01:48:54.000
Nezha.

1982
01:48:54.000 --> 01:48:56.000
I'm here, Mom.

1983
01:48:56.000 --> 01:48:57.000
You guys must not give up.

1984
01:48:57.000 --> 01:48:59.000
Don't worry about us.

1985
01:48:59.000 --> 01:49:00.000
Try to

1986
01:49:00.000 --> 01:49:01.000
stay focus.

1987
01:49:01.000 --> 01:49:03.000
I'm fine, Mom.

1988
01:49:03.000 --> 01:49:04.000
I don't feel the fire.

1989
01:49:04.000 --> 01:49:06.000
Nothing kills you, kiddo.

1990
01:49:06.000 --> 01:49:09.000
If I am correct,

1991
01:49:09.000 --> 01:49:11.000
flames of the Demon Orb
and the true fire of Samadhi

1992
01:49:11.000 --> 01:49:13.000
share the same origin.

1993
01:49:13.000 --> 01:49:16.000
Then the Tianyuan Cauldron can't harm you.

1994
01:49:16.000 --> 01:49:17.000
That's right.

1995
01:49:17.000 --> 01:49:20.000
My mistake.

1996
01:49:22.000 --> 01:49:23.000
Don't bother.

1997
01:49:23.000 --> 01:49:27.000
This is just my avatar.

1998
01:49:27.000 --> 01:49:29.000
As I suspected, the Demon Orb

1999
01:49:29.000 --> 01:49:30.000
is indestructible.

2000
01:49:30.000 --> 01:49:36.000
No wonder the Supreme Lord had
to destroy you with the Wrath of Heaven.

2001
01:49:39.000 --> 01:49:42.000
Nezha,

2002
01:49:42.000 --> 01:49:45.000
I see you're a good son.

2003
01:49:45.000 --> 01:49:47.000
How about I give you
a chance to prove that?

2004
01:49:47.000 --> 01:49:49.000
The Oblivion Pill.

2005
01:49:49.000 --> 01:49:51.000
Swallow it

2006
01:49:51.000 --> 01:49:53.000
and I'll release your parents.

2007
01:49:53.000 --> 01:49:54.000
What do you say?

2008
01:49:54.000 --> 01:49:57.000
I may be ruthless,

2009
01:49:57.000 --> 01:49:59.000
but I always keep my promises.

2010
01:49:59.000 --> 01:50:03.000
Otherwise, all those elites of the demons

2011
01:50:03.000 --> 01:50:05.000
wouldn't swear loyalty to me.

2012
01:50:05.000 --> 01:50:07.000
As long as you swallow it,

2013
01:50:07.000 --> 01:50:09.000
I swear to Heaven,

2014
01:50:09.000 --> 01:50:12.000
I won't harm your parents.

2015
01:50:25.000 --> 01:50:27.000
What are you doing?

2016
01:50:27.000 --> 01:50:30.000
Using his parents' lives to threaten a kid?

2017
01:50:30.000 --> 01:50:32.000
And you call yourself a god?

2018
01:50:32.000 --> 01:50:34.000
You aren't even worthy to be a human.

2019
01:50:35.000 --> 01:50:36.000
Nezha,

2020
01:50:36.000 --> 01:50:37.000
leave us be.

2021
01:50:37.000 --> 01:50:40.000
You must live.

2022
01:50:40.000 --> 01:50:41.000
Hold on until the
heart-piercing curse is broken

2023
01:50:41.000 --> 01:50:44.000
or your two brothers find you.

2024
01:50:44.000 --> 01:50:47.000
You really think I can't
kill the Demon Orb?

2025
01:50:47.000 --> 01:50:49.000
It's just a matter of time.

2026
01:50:49.000 --> 01:50:51.000
Once you're dead,

2027
01:50:51.000 --> 01:50:55.000
I have a hundred ways to destroy him.

2028
01:50:58.000 --> 01:51:03.000
I just don't want to die for nothing.

2029
01:51:03.000 --> 01:51:06.000
Why won't you let me?

2030
01:51:06.000 --> 01:51:09.000
Why won't you?

2031
01:51:09.000 --> 01:51:12.000
If your trade your life for ours,

2032
01:51:12.000 --> 01:51:17.000
do you think we could live in peace?

2033
01:51:18.000 --> 01:51:19.000
Nezha.

2034
01:51:19.000 --> 01:51:22.000
No, mom.

2035
01:51:22.000 --> 01:51:23.000
It'll hurt you.

2036
01:51:23.000 --> 01:51:24.000
It's okay.

2037
01:51:24.000 --> 01:51:27.000
This is the end.

2038
01:51:27.000 --> 01:51:30.000
I just want to hug you one last time.

2039
01:51:30.000 --> 01:51:33.000
Mom.

2040
01:51:33.000 --> 01:51:37.000
I guess I won't get to see you grow up.

2041
01:51:37.000 --> 01:51:39.000
From now on,

2042
01:51:39.000 --> 01:51:43.000
you'll have to walk your own path.

2043
01:52:47.000 --> 01:52:50.000
I... I'm useless.

2044
01:52:50.000 --> 01:52:53.000
Useless.

2045
01:52:53.000 --> 01:52:56.000
I was born a demon,

2046
01:52:56.000 --> 01:52:59.000
and have always caused you pain.

2047
01:52:59.000 --> 01:53:01.000
I wanted so badly,

2048
01:53:01.000 --> 01:53:04.000
to make you proud.

2049
01:53:09.000 --> 01:53:12.000
This is all my fault.

2050
01:53:12.000 --> 01:53:14.000
I'm sorry.

2051
01:53:14.000 --> 01:53:16.000
Mom.

2052
01:53:16.000 --> 01:53:19.000
I'm sorry.

2053
01:53:19.000 --> 01:53:23.000
Every day I spent with you,

2054
01:53:23.000 --> 01:53:26.000
I was so happy.

2055
01:53:26.000 --> 01:53:30.000
I never cared

2056
01:53:30.000 --> 01:53:31.000
whether you were an immortal

2057
01:53:31.000 --> 01:53:34.000
or a demon.

2058
01:53:34.000 --> 01:53:36.000
All I know is

2059
01:53:36.000 --> 01:53:41.000
you are my son.

2060
01:53:41.000 --> 01:53:43.000
Mommy

2061
01:53:43.000 --> 01:53:45.000
will always

2062
01:53:45.000 --> 01:53:47.000
love...

2063
01:54:25.000 --> 01:54:26.000
Nezha, stay calm!

2064
01:54:26.000 --> 01:54:27.000
Stop!

2065
01:54:27.000 --> 01:54:30.000
Your body will be torn apart!

2066
01:55:10.000 --> 01:55:13.000
The True Fire of Samadhi
has compensated for

2067
01:55:13.000 --> 01:55:15.000
the fire need for body rebuilding.

2068
01:55:15.000 --> 01:55:18.000
Nezha's physical form

2069
01:55:18.000 --> 01:55:22.000
is complete now!

2070
01:55:35.000 --> 01:55:37.000
Dad,

2071
01:55:37.000 --> 01:55:39.000
take care of Mom.

2072
01:55:50.000 --> 01:55:53.000
Help me break the cauldron!

2073
01:56:24.000 --> 01:56:28.000
They are absorbing the energy
of the Tianyuan Cauldron!

2074
01:56:28.000 --> 01:56:31.000
Roota Maxima!

2075
01:56:54.000 --> 01:56:56.000
Demon Hunters, by my command,

2076
01:56:56.000 --> 01:56:58.000
march!

2077
01:57:50.000 --> 01:57:51.000
Father,

2078
01:57:51.000 --> 01:57:52.000
you need to save your
energy for self-protection.

2079
01:57:52.000 --> 01:57:54.000
We've been backing down

2080
01:57:54.000 --> 01:57:55.000
for far too long.

2081
01:57:55.000 --> 01:57:57.000
We thought if we gave everything,

2082
01:57:57.000 --> 01:57:59.000
then Wuliang would let us live.

2083
01:57:59.000 --> 01:58:02.000
But in the end, they still want us dead.

2084
01:58:02.000 --> 01:58:04.000
If that's what they want,

2085
01:58:04.000 --> 01:58:07.000
then we'll fight them to death!

2086
01:58:07.000 --> 01:58:10.000
Yes, let's fight!

2087
01:58:10.000 --> 01:58:14.000
Fight! Fight! Fight!

2088
01:58:23.000 --> 01:58:26.000
We can't let them out!

2089
01:59:10.000 --> 01:59:11.000
Do not give up!

2090
01:59:11.000 --> 01:59:14.000
Hang in there!

2091
01:59:36.000 --> 01:59:39.000
Make it...

2092
01:59:39.000 --> 01:59:43.000
break!

2093
02:00:30.000 --> 02:00:31.000
The cauldron!

2094
02:00:31.000 --> 02:00:32.000
My cauldron!

2095
02:00:32.000 --> 02:00:36.000
There goes the foundation of Chan Sect!

2096
02:01:28.000 --> 02:01:32.000
Kill all these bastards!

2097
02:01:37.000 --> 02:01:39.000
Attack!

2098
02:02:11.000 --> 02:02:14.000
You ungrateful traitors.

2099
02:02:14.000 --> 02:02:16.000
Can't tell right from wrong!

2100
02:02:28.000 --> 02:02:31.000
Roaring Loong Waves!

2101
02:02:40.000 --> 02:02:42.000
So those two minions
of his are monsters too.

2102
02:02:42.000 --> 02:02:44.000
Demons, immortals...

2103
02:02:44.000 --> 02:02:47.000
it's all part of your trickery!

2104
02:02:47.000 --> 02:02:49.000
You despicable lowlife.

2105
02:02:49.000 --> 02:02:53.000
How dare you oppose me!

2106
02:03:14.000 --> 02:03:18.000
Witness my true powers!

2107
02:05:07.000 --> 02:05:09.000
I'll give you two

2108
02:05:09.000 --> 02:05:10.000
one last chance because I value talents.

2109
02:05:10.000 --> 02:05:12.000
Surrender now

2110
02:05:12.000 --> 02:05:14.000
and I'll grant you immortality.

2111
02:05:14.000 --> 02:05:16.000
Hell with immortality!

2112
02:05:16.000 --> 02:05:18.000
I'm all demon.

2113
02:05:18.000 --> 02:05:20.000
So what?

2114
02:05:23.000 --> 02:05:25.000
You claim to be a guiding light,

2115
02:05:25.000 --> 02:05:26.000
but all you do is bully the weak,

2116
02:05:26.000 --> 02:05:28.000
and bring chaos to the world.

2117
02:05:28.000 --> 02:05:32.000
You are the real evil!

2118
02:05:39.000 --> 02:05:40.000
Ignorant fools,

2119
02:05:40.000 --> 02:05:42.000
the immortals rule the world.

2120
02:05:42.000 --> 02:05:45.000
Siding with the powerful
is the only way out.

2121
02:05:45.000 --> 02:05:47.000
Either accept that or

2122
02:05:47.000 --> 02:05:49.000
you'll have no place to run to.

2123
02:05:49.000 --> 02:05:51.000
If no place to go,

2124
02:05:51.000 --> 02:05:54.000
I will open up one myself!

2125
02:05:56.000 --> 02:05:59.000
If not accepted,

2126
02:05:59.000 --> 02:06:03.000
I will overturn!

2127
02:06:12.000 --> 02:06:14.000
Master!

2128
02:06:14.000 --> 02:06:17.000
My face...

2129
02:06:17.000 --> 02:06:21.000
You fools broke my Ageless Spell!

2130
02:06:21.000 --> 02:06:24.000
Old fart.

2131
02:06:35.000 --> 02:06:38.000
Ba... back to the palace.

2132
02:06:49.000 --> 02:06:52.000
Wait for me!

2133
02:07:31.000 --> 02:07:33.000
My father plans to lead the Loongs

2134
02:07:33.000 --> 02:07:35.000
deep into the ocean to hide away.

2135
02:07:35.000 --> 02:07:36.000
Now that your identity is exposed,

2136
02:07:36.000 --> 02:07:38.000
why don't you come with us?

2137
02:07:38.000 --> 02:07:40.000
No.

2138
02:07:40.000 --> 02:07:42.000
I've been hiding all my life,

2139
02:07:42.000 --> 02:07:43.000
concealing myself

2140
02:07:43.000 --> 02:07:46.000
until there was nowhere to run.

2141
02:07:46.000 --> 02:07:48.000
Now I finally know how to face the world.

2142
02:07:48.000 --> 02:07:50.000
Wuliang is one of the
most powerful immortals

2143
02:07:50.000 --> 02:07:52.000
and is trusted by the Supreme Lord.

2144
02:07:52.000 --> 02:07:54.000
He may not fall so easily.

2145
02:07:54.000 --> 02:07:56.000
Plus, immortals and
demons walk different paths,

2146
02:07:56.000 --> 02:07:58.000
like water and fire.

2147
02:07:58.000 --> 02:08:00.000
Immortals, demons...

2148
02:08:00.000 --> 02:08:04.000
Those are just excuses for controlling
those who are different.

2149
02:08:04.000 --> 02:08:06.000
So what?

2150
02:08:06.000 --> 02:08:10.000
You think you can change that?

2151
02:08:12.000 --> 02:08:15.000
I want to try.

2152
02:08:16.000 --> 02:08:18.000
Perhaps I'm too old

2153
02:08:18.000 --> 02:08:22.000
to fight against the world.

2154
02:08:22.000 --> 02:08:24.000
Ao Bing.

2155
02:08:57.000 --> 02:08:58.000
I know that

2156
02:08:58.000 --> 02:09:00.000
once you've made up your mind,

2157
02:09:00.000 --> 02:09:03.000
you'll always follow through.

2158
02:09:03.000 --> 02:09:04.000
My son,

2159
02:09:04.000 --> 02:09:05.000
in the past,

2160
02:09:05.000 --> 02:09:07.000
I put too much a burden on you,

2161
02:09:07.000 --> 02:09:08.000
never even

2162
02:09:08.000 --> 02:09:10.000
cared what you think.

2163
02:09:10.000 --> 02:09:13.000
I apologize.

2164
02:09:13.000 --> 02:09:17.000
I only wanted to use my experience
to give you a good life.

2165
02:09:17.000 --> 02:09:19.000
But now I see,

2166
02:09:19.000 --> 02:09:20.000
the experience of the older generation

2167
02:09:20.000 --> 02:09:22.000
is but the past,

2168
02:09:22.000 --> 02:09:25.000
and may not be right for you.

2169
02:09:25.000 --> 02:09:28.000
You must walk your own path.

2170
02:09:28.000 --> 02:09:30.000
From now on,

2171
02:09:30.000 --> 02:09:34.000
follow your heart.

2172
02:10:03.000 --> 02:10:04.000
I knew you'd come back.

2173
02:10:04.000 --> 02:10:07.000
Why?

2174
02:10:07.000 --> 02:10:09.000
Because we are both too young.

2175
02:10:12.000 --> 02:10:15.000
Too young to fear.

2176
02:12:02.000 --> 02:12:03.000
Master,

2177
02:12:03.000 --> 02:12:04.000
Your face...

2178
02:12:04.000 --> 02:12:06.000
It's fine.

2179
02:12:06.000 --> 02:12:08.000
Crana already took care of it.

2180
02:12:08.000 --> 02:12:10.000
The cauldron is destroyed

2181
02:12:10.000 --> 02:12:11.000
and the Chan Sect is not a sure-win.

2182
02:12:11.000 --> 02:12:14.000
And we've committed an unforgivable crime.

2183
02:12:14.000 --> 02:12:18.000
We must act before the Master
comes out of seclusion.

2184
02:12:18.000 --> 02:12:19.000
Come on,

2185
02:12:19.000 --> 02:12:21.000
let's go see him.

2186
02:12:21.000 --> 02:12:23.000
Is the holding cell hidden enough?

2187
02:12:23.000 --> 02:12:25.000
No one else will come here.

2188
02:12:25.000 --> 02:12:27.000
The cell is also shielded from magic.

2189
02:12:27.000 --> 02:12:28.000
And gate can only be opened

2190
02:12:28.000 --> 02:12:30.000
by you and the only guard.

2191
02:12:30.000 --> 02:12:32.000
Hmm.

2192
02:12:37.000 --> 02:12:39.000
Slacking.

2193
02:12:39.000 --> 02:12:41.000
Dozing off.

2194
02:12:45.000 --> 02:12:46.000
What's going on?

2195
02:12:46.000 --> 02:12:47.000
This gate

2196
02:12:47.000 --> 02:12:48.000
works with face-recognition.

2197
02:12:48.000 --> 02:12:50.000
Since your appearance has changed,

2198
02:12:50.000 --> 02:12:52.000
you need to re-register.

2199
02:12:52.000 --> 02:12:54.000
Go ahead.

2200
02:13:20.000 --> 02:13:22.000
Are you mocking me?

2201
02:13:22.000 --> 02:13:24.000
I curse you to sleep for ten years.

2202
02:13:30.000 --> 02:13:32.000
You've suffered,

2203
02:13:32.000 --> 02:13:34.000
my brother.

2204
02:13:35.000 --> 02:13:37.000
It is you who have suffered, brother.

2205
02:13:37.000 --> 02:13:40.000
Who... who did this to you?

2206
02:13:40.000 --> 02:13:41.000
Hmph.

2207
02:13:41.000 --> 02:13:46.000
Do you know why I recruited you back then?

2208
02:13:46.000 --> 02:13:49.000
I needed a demon.

2209
02:13:49.000 --> 02:13:51.000
When the Deification War comes,

2210
02:13:51.000 --> 02:13:55.000
I will entrust you with an important task.

2211
02:13:55.000 --> 02:13:57.000
Delusional.

2212
02:13:58.000 --> 02:14:01.000
Father!

2213
02:14:01.000 --> 02:14:02.000
Don't worry.

2214
02:14:02.000 --> 02:14:04.000
He's still breathing.

2215
02:14:04.000 --> 02:14:07.000
Let me place a curse on you,

2216
02:14:07.000 --> 02:14:10.000
and your father will
live a comfortable life

2217
02:14:10.000 --> 02:14:14.000
at Yu Xu Palace.

2218
02:14:15.000 --> 02:14:17.000
Your two guests have arrived.

2219
02:14:17.000 --> 02:14:20.000
Think about it.

2220
02:14:26.000 --> 02:14:28.000
Hmm?

2221
02:14:28.000 --> 02:14:31.000
The medicine is working.

2222
02:14:31.000 --> 02:14:32.000
What should we do now?

2223
02:14:32.000 --> 02:14:35.000
Who else can open the gate?

2224
02:14:39.000 --> 02:14:42.000
Ten years...

2225
02:14:48.000 --> 02:14:50.000
Jinzha of Cloud Cave, Wulong Mountain,

2226
02:14:50.000 --> 02:14:52.000
Muzha of White Crane
Cave, Jiugong Mountain,

2227
02:14:52.000 --> 02:14:55.000
reporting back to duty.

2228
02:14:59.000 --> 02:15:00.000
Master,

2229
02:15:00.000 --> 02:15:02.000
bear with me a little longer.

2230
02:15:06.000 --> 02:15:09.000
I think it's enough.

2231
02:15:14.000 --> 02:15:15.000
It seems

2232
02:15:15.000 --> 02:15:17.000
the left eye still isn't swollen enough.

2233
02:15:17.000 --> 02:15:19.000
Add some more to the right cheek, too.

2234
02:15:20.000 --> 02:15:22.000
Wait.

2235
02:15:22.000 --> 02:15:23.000
Were you just laughing at me?

2236
02:15:23.000 --> 02:15:24.000
We wouldn't dare.

2237
02:15:24.000 --> 02:15:25.000
Master, you're suffering.

2238
02:15:25.000 --> 02:15:27.000
It pains our hearts to see you like this.

2239
02:15:27.000 --> 02:15:28.000
Really?

2240
02:15:28.000 --> 02:15:29.000
We solemnly swear

2241
02:15:29.000 --> 02:15:31.000
to heaven and earth.

2242
02:15:35.000 --> 02:15:37.000
Alright, alright.

2243
02:15:47.000 --> 02:15:48.000
I might have...

2244
02:15:48.000 --> 02:15:49.000
beaten too hard.

2245
02:15:49.000 --> 02:15:50.000
What?

2246
02:15:50.000 --> 02:15:51.000
Don't worry.

2247
02:15:51.000 --> 02:15:53.000
Put it on, we'll come back when it heals.

2248
02:15:53.000 --> 02:15:55.000
Master, you're meant for greatness.

2249
02:15:55.000 --> 02:15:57.000
This is all for the
future of the Chan Sect.

2250
02:15:57.000 --> 02:15:58.000
Let's try a few more times,

2251
02:15:58.000 --> 02:15:59.000
we'll get it right eventually.

2252
02:15:59.000 --> 02:16:00.000
Don't let him go!

2253
02:16:00.000 --> 02:16:01.000
Quick!

2254
02:16:01.000 --> 02:16:03.000
Do it!

2255
02:16:03.000 --> 02:16:06.000
Let go of me!

